,"node_id":"U_kgDODvPiiw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commits/99334666215f4c560f6abf7cd4fd9058e2ae8f5f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T17:37:09Z","email":"skant.dev1@gmail.com","name":"shashikant maurya"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T17:37:09Z","email":"skant.dev1@gmail.com","name":"shashikant maurya"},"message":"feat: Step 10 - Add @repo/hooks package with 15 custom hooks\n\nHooks included:\n- useApi: Generic async API call with loading/error state\n- useDebounce: Debounce any value by a delay\n- useLocalStorage: Persist state to localStorage with cross-tab sync\n- usePagination: Full-featured pagination state (pages, offset, prev/next)\n- useInfiniteScroll: IntersectionObserver-based infinite scroll\n- useTheme: Light/dark theme with system preference and persistence\n- useModal: Modal open/close state management\n- useDisclosure: Generic open/close toggle state\n- useAuth: Authentication state via React context\n- usePermission: Role-based permission check (RBAC)\n- usePrevious: Track previous value across renders\n- useClickOutside: Detect clicks outside a DOM element\n- useSearch: Client-side search with debouncing\n- useCart: Shopping cart backed by localStorage\n- useProducts: Paginated product fetching with filters\n\nAll hooks:\n- Fully typed with TypeScript generics\n- Aligned with @repo/types interfaces\n- Handle cleanup/unmount safety\n- Documented with JSDoc and usage examples","tree":{"sha":"22ef0543002d470f4a220fb9