ErrorState\n\nComponents are ready for use in host app and micro frontends.","tree":{"sha":"74fe936665c6e9636c9c0e8ed8009212acdc43b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/git/trees/74fe936665c6e9636c9c0e8ed8009212acdc43b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/git/commits/3125e442f0bffaabe92fc28108a52bb9c0d5f4ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250864267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/skantdev","id":250864267,"login":"skantdev","node_id":"U_kgDODvPiiw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commit/3125e442f0bffaabe92fc28108a52bb9c0d5f4ac","node_id":"C_kwDOTWd-D9oAKDMxMjVlNDQyZjBiZmZhYWJlOTJmYzI4MTA4YTUyYmI5YzBkNWY0YWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commit/559cdd2088f47136f2718a35df6f727fc9d0538f","sha":"559cdd2088f47136f2718a35df6f727fc9d0538f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commits/559cdd2088f47136f2718a35df6f727fc9d0538f"}],"sha":"3125e442f0bffaabe92fc28108a52bb9c0d5f4ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commits/3125e442f0bffaabe92fc28108a52bb9c0d5f4ac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250864267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/skantdev","id":250864267,"login":"skantdev","node_id":"U_kgDODvPiiw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commits/559cdd2088f47136f2718a35df6f727fc9d0538f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T18:26:29Z","email":"skant.dev1@gmail.com","name":"shashikant maurya"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T18:26:29Z","email":"skant.dev1@gmail.com","name":"shashikant maurya"},"message":"feat(utils): create @repo/utils package with 150+ utility functions\n\nAdd comprehensive utility library covering 8 categories:\n\nDate utilities (using date-fns):\n- formatDate(), formatDateShort(), formatDateTime(), formatRelativeTime()\n- isToday(), isPast(), isFuture()\n- getDaysDifference(), addDaysToDate(), getStartOfDay()\n- parseDate(), isValidDate()\n\nCurrency utilities (cents-based):\n- formatCurrency(), formatMoney(), parseCurrency()\n- addCurrency(), multiplyCurrency(), calculatePercentage()\n- applyDiscount(), calculateTax(), formatPriceWithTax()\n- compareCurrency(), isZero(), isPositive(), isNegative()\n\nString utilities:\n- capitalize(), capitalizeWords(), truncate(), slugify()\n- mask(), maskEmail(), maskCreditCard()\n- formatPhoneNumber(), formatCreditCard()\n- randomString(), pluralize(), getInitials()\n- escapeHtml(), stripHtml()\n\nValidation utilities:\n- isValidEmail(), isStrongPassword(), getPasswordStrength()\n- isValidPhone(), isValidCreditCard(), isValidCreditCardLuhn()\n- isValidCVV(), isValidURL(), isValidUsername()\n- isRequired(), hasMinLength(), hasMaxLength(), isInRange()\n- isValidFileType(), isValidFileSize(), isValidImage()\n\nStorage utilities (type-safe):\n- getLocalStorage<T>(), setLocalStorage<T>()\n- getSessionStorage<T>(), setSessionStorage<T>()\n- removeLocalStorage(), clearLocalStorage()\n- hasLocalStorageKey(), getStorageSize()\n\nArray utilities:\n- unique(), uniqueBy(), groupBy(), chunk(), flatten()\n- shuffle(), randomItem(), randomItems(), sortBy()\n- difference(), intersection(), union()\n- sum(), average(), min(), max(), partition()\n- remove(), removeAt(), insertAt(), move()\n\nObject utilities:\n- pick(), omit(), deepClone(), deepMerge()\n- isEmpty(), getNestedValue(), setNestedValue()\n- mapValues(), filterObject(), invert()\n- keys(), values(), entries(), flattenObject()\n- arrayToObject(), areObjectsEqual()\n\nNumber utilities:\n- clamp(), random(), randomInt(), round()\n- formatNumber(), formatPercentage(), formatBytes()\n- percentage(), percentageChange()\n- mean(), median(), mode(), standardDeviation()\n- isEven(), isOdd(), isInteger(), isFloat()\n- safeDivide(), lerp(), map()\n\nDesign principles:\n- Type-safe with TypeScript generics\n- Immutable operations (no mutation)\n- Cents-based currency to avoid floating-point issues\n- Server-side safe storage utilities\n- Error handling with fallbacks\n\nDependencies:\n- date-fns@^3.3.1 for date manipulation\n- @repo/constants for validation regex and limits\n- @repo/types for Money type\n- @types/node@^20.12.12\n\nIncludes comprehensive README.md with examples and best practices.\n\nResolves Step 7 of project plan.","tree":{"sha":"a2d16ffd95a4366c28b6729a6fc03d2685b7e393","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/git/trees/a2d16ffd95a4366c28b6729a6fc03d2685b7e393"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/git/commits/559cdd2088f47136f2718a35df6f727fc9d0538f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250864267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/skantdev","id":250864267,"login":"skantdev","node_id":"U_kgDODvPiiw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commit/559cdd2088f47136f2718a35df6f727fc9d0538f","node_id":"C_kwDOTWd-D9oAKDU1OWNkZDIwODhmNDcxMzZmMjcxOGEzNWRmNmY3MjdmYzlkMDUzOGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commit/fe78d7ec7ebfa8b14f353409067ab3c371924f09","sha":"fe78d7ec7ebfa8b14f353409067ab3c371924f09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commits/fe78d7ec7ebfa8b14f353409067ab3c371924f09"}],"sha":"559cdd2088f47136f2718a35df6f727fc9d0538f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commits/559cdd2088f47136f2718a35df6f727fc9d0538f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250864267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/skantdev","id":250864267,"login":"skantdev","node_id":"U_kgDODvPiiw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commits/fe78d7ec7ebfa8b14f353409067ab3c371924f09/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T18:17:29Z","email":"skant.dev1@gmail.com","name":"shashikant maurya"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T18:17:29Z","email":"skant.dev1@gmail.com","name":"shashikant maurya"},"message":"feat(api): create @repo/api package with Axios client and interceptors\n\nAdd comprehensive HTTP API client for all micro frontends with interceptors:\n\nAxios Configuration (client.ts):\n- Factory function createApiClient() for custom instances\n- Default apiClient with base URL from @repo/config\n- Timeout: 30 seconds (configurable via config.api.timeout)\n- Default headers: Content-Type and Accept application/json\n- isAxiosError helper for error type checking\n\nAuthentication Interceptor (auth.interceptor.ts):\n- Automatically injects auth tokens from localStorage\n- Reads STORAGE_KEYS.AUTH_TOKEN and adds to Authorization header\n- Format: Authorization: Bearer <token>\n- saveAuthToken(), saveRefreshToken() for token management\n- clearAuthTokens() for logout\n- getRefreshToken() exported for future token refresh logic\n- Server-side safe: checks typeof window before localStorage access\n\nError Interceptor (error.interceptor.ts):\n- Transforms Axios errors into consistent ApiError objects\n- Network errors -> NETWORK_ERROR code\n- Maps HTTP status codes to friendly error messages:\n  - 400 -> VALIDATION_ERROR\n  - 401 -> UNAUTHORIZED\n  - 403 -> FORBIDDEN\n  - 404 -> NOT_FOUND\n  - 408 -> TIMEOUT\n  - 429 -> RATE_LIMIT_EXCEEDED\n  - 500 -> INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR\n  - 503 -> SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE\n- Extracts error details from server response\n- Adds timestamp to all errors (ISO 8601)\n- Logs errors in development mode\n- transformError() helper for manual error transformation\n\nRetry Interceptor (retry.interceptor.ts):\n- Automatic retry with exponential backoff\n- Max attempts: 3 (from config.api.retryAttempts)\n- Base delay: 1000ms (from config.api.retryDelay)\n- Exponential backoff: 1s, 2s, 4s, 8s, ...\n- Retryable errors:\n  - Network errors (no response)\n  - 408 Request Timeout\n  - 429 Too Many Requests\n  - 500 Internal Server Error\n  - 502 Bad Gateway\n  - 503 Service Unavailable\n  - 504 Gateway Timeout\n- Non-retryable errors fail immediately (400, 401, 403, 404, etc.)\n- Logs retry attempts in development mode\n- Uses __retryCount on request config to track attempts\n\nLogging Interceptor (logging.interceptor.ts):\n- Development-only logging (process.env.NODE_ENV === ''development'')\n- Logs requests with 🚀 emoji: method, url, params, data, headers\n- Logs responses with ✅ emoji: status, statusText, data\n- Logs errors with ❌ emoji\n- Automatically disabled in production\n- Useful for debugging API calls during development\n\nRequest Utilities (utils/request.ts):\n- get<T>() - Typed GET requests\n- post<T, D>() - Typed POST requests with data\n- put<T, D>() - Typed PUT requests with data\n- patch<T, D>() - Typed PATCH requests with data\n- del<T>() - Typed DELETE requests\n- getPaginated<T>() - GET with pagination params\n- buildQueryString() - Build URL query strings from objects\n- All functions return ApiResponse<T> or PaginatedResponse<T>\n- Full TypeScript generics support for type safety\n\nUpload Utilities (utils/upload.ts):\n- uploadFile() - Single file upload with progress tracking\n- uploadFiles() - Multiple file upload with progress tracking\n- uploadWithData() - File upload with additional metadata\n- FormData construction with multipart/form-data headers\n- onProgress callback: (progress: number) => void (0-100%)\n- Returns FileUploadResponse with URL, size, type, etc.\n\nInterceptor Setup (interceptors/index.ts):\n- setupInterceptors() - Configure all interceptors\n- Order matters for correct behavior:\n  1. Logging (request) - log before modification\n  2. Auth - add auth token\n  3. Retry (response) - retry before error handling\n  4. Error (response) - transform errors\n  5. Logging (response) - log after processing\n- Individual setup functions exported for custom configurations\n- All interceptors can be used independently\n\nMain API Export (api.ts):\n- Pre-configured apiClient with all interceptors\n- Ready to use out of the box\n- Exports Axios types for convenience\n\nType Safety Updates (packages/types):\n- Added statusCode?: number to ApiError interface\n- Added timestamp?: string to ApiError interface\n- Enables consistent error structure across all APIs\n- Maintains backward compatibility with optional fields\n\nEnvironment Type Definitions (vite-env.d.ts):\n- ImportMetaEnv interface for Vite environment variables\n- ImportMeta.env property definition\n- Supports VITE_* prefixed variables\n- Index signature for dynamic environment variable access\n- Fixes TypeScript errors for import.meta.env in config package\n\nDependencies:\n- axios@^1.7.2 - HTTP client library\n- @repo/config - Configuration (base URL, timeout, retry settings)\n- @repo/constants - HTTP status codes, error messages, storage keys\n- @repo/types - TypeScript types for requests/responses\n- @types/node@^20.12.12 - Node.js type definitions (process.env)\n\nBenefits:\n- Single source for all API calls\n- Consistent error handling across all micro frontends\n- Automatic authentication token injection\n- Retry logic prevents transient failure errors\n- Type-safe API calls with generics\n- Progress tracking for file uploads\n- Development logging for debugging\n- Production-ready with proper error transformation\n- Server-side safe (checks window before localStorage)\n- Extensible (create custom clients with createApiClient())\n\nUsage Examples:\n- Simple GET: await get<Product>(''/products/123'')\n- POST with data: await post<Order>(''/orders'', orderData)\n- Paginated: await getPaginated<Product[]>(''/products'', { page: 1, limit: 20 })\n- Upload: await uploadFile(''/images'', file, (progress) => console.log(progress))\n- Auth: saveAuthToken(token); await get(''/profile'')\n- Error: try { await get(''/data'') } catch (error) { const apiError = error as ApiError }\n\nFiles: 14 (package.json, tsconfig, vite-env, 4 interceptors, api, client, 2 utils, index, README)\nLines: ~1000 lines of API client code\nExports: 30+ utilities and types\n\nProgress: 6/27 steps (22.2%)\nNext: Step 7 - Create @repo/utils package with utility functions","tree":{"sha":"75311af3903810eab4911591e61b0b2f024899a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/git/trees/75311af3903810eab4911591e61b0b2f024899a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/git/commits/fe78d7ec7ebfa8b14f353409067ab3c371924f09","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250864267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/skantdev","id":250864267,"login":"skantdev","node_id":"U_kgDODvPiiw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commit/fe78d7ec7ebfa8b14f353409067ab3c371924f09","node_id":"C_kwDOTWd-D9oAKGZlNzhkN2VjN2ViZmE4YjE0ZjM1MzQwOTA2N2FiM2MzNzE5MjRmMDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commit/69c46b68cd48fc63cb0401a82016c2cc832acecd","sha":"69c46b68cd48fc63cb0401a82016c2cc832acecd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commits/69c46b68cd48fc63cb0401a82016c2cc832acecd"}],"sha":"fe78d7ec7ebfa8b14f353409067ab3c371924f09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commits/fe78d7ec7ebfa8b14f353409067ab3c371924f09"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250864267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/skantdev","id":250864267,"login":"skantdev","node_id":"U_kgDODvPiiw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commits/69c46b68cd48fc63cb0401a82016c2cc832acecd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T18:07:09Z","email":"skant.dev1@gmail.com","name":"shashikant maurya"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T18:07:09Z","email":"skant.dev1@gmail.com","name":"shashikant maurya"},"message":"feat(constants): create @repo/constants package with application-wide constants\n\nAdd comprehensive constants library for consistent values across all micro frontends:\n\nRoutes (40+ route constants):\n- Public routes: HOME, LOGIN, REGISTER, PRODUCTS, PRODUCT_DETAIL, etc.\n- Protected routes: PROFILE, ORDERS, WISHLIST, etc.\n- Admin routes: ADMIN_DASHBOARD, ADMIN_PRODUCTS, ADMIN_ORDERS, etc.\n- Error routes: NOT_FOUND, UNAUTHORIZED, FORBIDDEN, SERVER_ERROR\n- Helper functions: buildRoute(), buildRouteWithQuery() for dynamic routing\n- Type-safe route building with path parameters and query strings\n\nStorage Keys (30+ keys):\n- LocalStorage keys: All prefixed with ''ecommerce_'' to avoid conflicts\n  - Auth: AUTH_TOKEN, REFRESH_TOKEN, TOKEN_EXPIRY, REMEMBER_ME, USER\n  - Shopping: CART, CART_ID, WISHLIST, RECENTLY_VIEWED\n  - Preferences: THEME, LANGUAGE, CURRENCY, SIDEBAR_COLLAPSED\n  - Filters: PRODUCT_FILTERS, PRODUCT_SORT\n  - Onboarding: ONBOARDING_COMPLETED, TOUR_COMPLETED\n  - Analytics: ANALYTICS_CONSENT, TRACKING_ID\n  - Temporary: REDIRECT_URL, LAST_VISITED_PAGE\n- SessionStorage keys: SESSION_ID, CHECKOUT_STEP, SEARCH_HISTORY\n- Cookie keys: AUTH_TOKEN (httpOnly), THEME, COOKIE_CONSENT\n\nValidation Rules (15+ regex patterns):\n- Email: EMAIL_REGEX (RFC 5322 compliant)\n- Password: PASSWORD_STRONG_REGEX (uppercase, lowercase, number, special char)\n- Phone: PHONE_REGEX (international), US_PHONE_REGEX, UK_POSTCODE_REGEX\n- Payment: CREDIT_CARD_REGEX, CVV_REGEX\n- URL: URL_REGEX, SLUG_REGEX\n- Text: USERNAME_REGEX, ALPHANUMERIC_REGEX, HEX_COLOR_REGEX\n- Validation constraints: 30+ limits for password length, username length,\n  product name/description, review length, rating range, image size, etc.\n- Validation messages: Pre-defined error messages for common validation failures\n\nHTTP & Messages (70+ messages):\n- HTTP status codes: 25+ codes (200, 201, 400, 401, 403, 404, 500, etc.)\n- API error messages: NETWORK_ERROR, TIMEOUT, UNAUTHORIZED, VALIDATION_ERROR,\n  OUT_OF_STOCK, PAYMENT_FAILED, RATE_LIMIT_EXCEEDED, etc.\n- Success messages: LOGIN_SUCCESS, ORDER_PLACED, PROFILE_UPDATED, etc.\n- Confirmation messages: DELETE_ACCOUNT, CANCEL_ORDER, CLEAR_CART, etc.\n\nFormats & Localization:\n- Date formats: ISO, SHORT, MEDIUM, LONG, FULL, RELATIVE, API formats\n- Time formats: 12H, 24H, with seconds\n- Currency: 12 currency codes (USD, EUR, GBP, etc.) with symbols\n- Languages: 12 language codes (en, es, fr, de, etc.)\n- Countries: 14 country codes (US, GB, CA, etc.)\n- Timezones: 10 major timezones (UTC, EST, PST, GMT, JST, etc.)\n- Number formats: decimal separator, thousands separator, currency decimals\n- File sizes: Units (B, KB, MB, GB, TB) and byte conversions\n\nApplication Limits (50+ limits):\n- Pagination: MIN_PAGE (1), DEFAULT_PAGE_SIZE (20), MAX_PAGE_SIZE (100)\n- Products: MAX_PRODUCT_IMAGES (10), MAX_CART_QUANTITY (99), price ranges\n- Search: MIN_SEARCH_LENGTH (2), DEBOUNCE_MS (300), MAX_SUGGESTIONS (10)\n- Cart: MAX_CART_ITEMS (50), CART_PERSISTENCE_DAYS (30)\n- Wishlist: MAX_WISHLIST_ITEMS (100)\n- Reviews: MAX_REVIEW_IMAGES (5), rating range (1-5)\n- Files: MAX_FILE_SIZE_MB (5), MAX_BULK_UPLOAD (10)\n- API: TIMEOUT_MS (30000), RETRY_ATTEMPTS (3), RETRY_DELAY_MS (1000)\n- Rate limiting: WINDOW_MS (60000), MAX_REQUESTS (100)\n- Session: TIMEOUT_MINUTES (30), REMEMBER_ME_DAYS (30)\n- Cache: TTL_SECONDS (300), MAX_SIZE_MB (50)\n- Text lengths: password, name, email, description limits\n- Animations: FAST (150ms), NORMAL (300ms), SLOW (500ms)\n- Toasts: DURATION_MS (5000), MAX_TOASTS (5)\n\nUI Constants:\n- Breakpoints: XS (320), SM (640), MD (768), LG (1024), XL (1280), XXL (1536)\n- Z-Index layers: DROPDOWN (1000), MODAL (1050), TOOLTIP (1070), TOAST (1080)\n- Defaults: theme, language, currency, country, pagination, sort order\n- Social platforms: Facebook, Twitter, Instagram, LinkedIn, etc.\n- Payment providers: Stripe, PayPal, Credit Card, Cash on Delivery, etc.\n- Shipping carriers: USPS, FedEx, UPS, DHL, Amazon Logistics\n\nBenefits:\n- Single source of truth: No magic strings or numbers scattered across codebase\n- Type safety: All constants use ''as const'' for type narrowing and autocomplete\n- Consistency: Ensures all micro frontends use same values\n- Maintainability: Update once, reflect everywhere\n- Discoverability: IDE autocomplete shows all available constants\n- Testability: Easy to mock and test validation rules\n- Localization ready: Currency, language, timezone support built-in\n- No conflicts: All storage keys are prefixed with ''ecommerce_''\n\nUsage Examples:\n- Routes: navigate(ROUTES.PRODUCTS)\n- Storage: localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEYS.AUTH_TOKEN, token)\n- Validation: if (!EMAIL_REGEX.test(email)) { showError(VALIDATION_MESSAGES.EMAIL_INVALID) }\n- Messages: if (status === HTTP_STATUS.NOT_FOUND) { showError(API_ERROR_MESSAGES.NOT_FOUND) }\n- Formats: format(date, DATE_FORMATS.MEDIUM)\n- Limits: if (cart.length >= LIMITS.MAX_CART_ITEMS) { showError() }\n\nFiles: 9 (package.json, tsconfig, 6 source files, README)\nLines: ~1200 lines of constants\nExports: 200+ constants across 7 categories\n\nProgress: 5/27 steps (18.5%)\nNext: Step 6 - Create @repo/api package with Axios client","tree":{"sha":"7233b2eddd8df6bd69fbaf3d5795dfdcc63098ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/git/trees/7233b2eddd8df6bd69fbaf3d5795dfdcc63098ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/git/commits/69c46b68cd48fc63cb0401a82016c2cc832acecd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250864267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/skantdev","id":250864267,"login":"skantdev","node_id":"U_kgDODvPiiw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commit/69c46b68cd48fc63cb0401a82016c2cc832acecd","node_id":"C_kwDOTWd-D9oAKDY5YzQ2YjY4Y2Q0OGZjNjNjYjA0MDFhODIwMTZjMmNjODMyYWNlY2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commit/4c7fc855dbf40998a87e296fe467ca89ea537f3e","sha":"4c7fc855dbf40998a87e296fe467ca89ea537f3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commits/4c7fc855dbf40998a87e296fe467ca89ea537f3e"}],"sha":"69c46b68cd48fc63cb0401a82016c2cc832acecd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commits/69c46b68cd48fc63cb0401a82016c2cc832acecd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250864267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/skantdev","id":250864267,"login":"skantdev","node_id":"U_kgDODvPiiw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commits/4c7fc855dbf40998a87e296fe467ca89ea537f3e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T18:01:36Z","email":"skant.dev1@gmail.com","name":"shashikant maurya"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T18:01:36Z","email":"skant.dev1@gmail.com","name":"shashikant maurya"},"message":"feat(config): create @repo/config package for centralized configuration management\n\nAdd comprehensive configuration system with environment detection and feature flags:\n\nCore Configuration (config.ts):\n- Application settings: env, version, build time, environment flags\n- API configuration: base URL, timeout (30s), retry logic (3 attempts)\n- 10 API endpoints: auth, users, products, cart, orders, payments, etc.\n- Authentication: token management, session timeout (30min), password rules\n- Storage: prefixed keys for localStorage (ecommerce_*)\n- Pagination: default limit (20), max limit (100)\n- Image CDN: 4 sizes (thumbnail to large), format support (webp, jpg, png)\n- SEO: meta tags, OG image, Twitter handle, structured data\n- Analytics: Google Analytics, Facebook Pixel, Mixpanel integration\n- Error tracking: Sentry integration with environment-aware sample rates\n- Cache: TTL (5min), max size (50MB), strategy options\n- Rate limiting: 100 requests per minute\n\nFeature Flags (25+ flags):\n- User: registration, social login, guest checkout, wishlist, compare\n- Product: reviews, Q&A, related products, recently viewed\n- Cart: persistence, sharing, save for later\n- Checkout: express checkout, multiple addresses, gift wrap, notes\n- Payment: credit card, PayPal, Stripe, cash on delivery\n- Admin: analytics, admin panel, bulk operations\n- Experimental: AI recommendations, virtual try-on, chat support (off by default)\n\nEnvironment Utilities (env.ts):\n- Auto-detect environment: development, staging, production, test\n- Cross-platform: supports Vite (import.meta.env) and Node (process.env)\n- Environment helpers: getEnvVar(), isBrowser(), isNode()\n- Dynamic base URLs per environment\n- CDN URL configuration per environment\n- Environment variable validation\n\nHelper Functions:\n- getConfig<T>(path): Access nested config by dot notation\n- isFeatureEnabled(flag): Check if feature flag is on\n- getApiEndpoint(name): Get full API endpoint URL\n- getStorageKey(key): Get prefixed storage key\n- getImageUrl(path, size): Get CDN URL with size\n- isEnvironment(env): Check current environment\n\nType Safety:\n- 11 TypeScript interfaces for all config sections\n- Fully typed environment variables (vite-env.d.ts)\n- Type-safe feature flag checking\n- IntelliSense support for all config paths\n\nBenefits:\n- Single source of truth for all configuration\n- Environment-specific settings without code changes\n- Feature flags for gradual rollout and A/B testing\n- Type-safe configuration access\n- Easy to test and maintain\n\nUsage:\nimport { config, isFeatureEnabled, getApiEndpoint } from ''@repo/config'';\n\nFiles: 8 (package.json, tsconfig, 4 source files, vite-env, README)\nLines: ~800 lines of configuration code\nExports: 20+ utilities and all config types\n\nProgress: 4/27 steps (14.8%)\nNext: Step 5 - Create @repo/constants package","tree":{"sha":"8a59aa5ffa4cbccf7a81d22fcb1476ce4bea7422","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/git/trees/8a59aa5ffa4cbccf7a81d22fcb1476ce4bea7422"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/git/commits/4c7fc855dbf40998a87e296fe467ca89ea537f3e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250864267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/skantdev","id":250864267,"login":"skantdev","node_id":"U_kgDODvPiiw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commit/4c7fc855dbf40998a87e296fe467ca89ea537f3e","node_id":"C_kwDOTWd-D9oAKDRjN2ZjODU1ZGJmNDA5OThhODdlMjk2ZmU0NjdjYTg5ZWE1MzdmM2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commit/feff1d400fc675ac87c90a7f593a0a344e73b0fd","sha":"feff1d400fc675ac87c90a7f593a0a344e73b0fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commits/feff1d400fc675ac87c90a7f593a0a344e73b0fd"}],"sha":"4c7fc855dbf40998a87e296fe467ca89ea537f3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commits/4c7fc855dbf40998a87e296fe467ca89ea537f3e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250864267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/skantdev","id":250864267,"login":"skantdev","node_id":"U_kgDODvPiiw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commits/feff1d400fc675ac87c90a7f593a0a344e73b0fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T17:31:29Z","email":"skant.dev1@gmail.com","name":"shashikant maurya"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T17:31:29Z","email":"skant.dev1@gmail.com","name":"shashikant maurya"},"message":"feat(types): create @repo/types shared package with comprehensive TypeScript definitions\n\nAdd centralized type definitions for all micro frontends:\n\nCore Types (common.types.ts):\n- Utility types: Nullable, Optional, DeepPartial\n- Common types: ID, Timestamp, Money, Address, Image\n- Pagination: PaginationParams, PaginationMeta, PaginatedResponse\n\nUser Types (user.types.ts):\n- Enums: UserRole (4 roles), UserPermission (14 permissions), UserStatus\n- Interfaces: User, UserProfile, UserPreferences, UserSession\n- Auth: UserRegistration, UserLoginCredentials, PasswordReset\n\nProduct Types (product.types.ts):\n- Enums: ProductStatus (4 statuses)\n- Interfaces: Product, ProductListItem, ProductVariant, ProductReview\n- Supporting: Category, Brand, ProductRating, ProductFilters\n- Sort options: ProductSortBy type\n\nCart Types (cart.types.ts):\n- Interfaces: Cart, CartItem, CartSummary, Coupon\n- Actions: AddToCartRequest, UpdateCartItemRequest, ApplyCouponRequest\n\nOrder Types (order.types.ts):\n- Enums: OrderStatus (8 statuses), PaymentMethod (6 methods), PaymentStatus\n- Interfaces: Order, OrderItem, PaymentInfo, ShippingInfo\n- Actions: CreateOrderRequest, CancelOrderRequest, ReturnRequest\n- Supporting: ShippingMethod, OrderStatusHistory\n\nAPI Types (api.types.ts):\n- Enums: ApiErrorCode (25+ error codes)\n- Responses: ApiResponse<T>, ApiErrorResponse, ValidationError\n- Config: ApiRequestOptions, ApiPaginationParams\n- Supporting: FileUploadResponse, HealthCheckResponse\n\nDesign Principles:\n- Money type in cents to avoid floating-point precision issues\n- ISO 8601 Timestamp strings for consistency\n- Strict typing with no ''any'' types\n- Comprehensive JSDoc comments\n- Enum-based status values for type safety\n- Immutable type definitions\n\nUsage:\nimport type { User, Product, Cart, Order } from ''@repo/types'';\nimport { UserRole, OrderStatus, PaymentMethod } from ''@repo/types'';\n\nBenefits:\n- Type safety across all micro frontends\n- Autocomplete and IntelliSense support\n- Compile-time error detection\n- Consistent data structures\n- Self-documenting code via JSDoc\n\nFiles: 10 (package.json, tsconfig, 6 type files, index, README)\nLines: ~1000 lines of TypeScript definitions\nExport: 100+ types, interfaces, and enums\n\nProgress: 3/27 steps (11.1%)\nNext: Step 4 - Create @repo/config package","tree":{"sha":"e8250a519ed90bd7fb0e7739a6822c2912e26b45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/git/trees/e8250a519ed90bd7fb0e7739a6822c2912e26b45"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/git/commits/feff1d400fc675ac87c90a7f593a0a344e73b0fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250864267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/skantdev","id":250864267,"login":"skantdev","node_id":"U_kgDODvPiiw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commit/feff1d400fc675ac87c90a7f593a0a344e73b0fd","node_id":"C_kwDOTWd-D9oAKGZlZmYxZDQwMGZjNjc1YWM4N2M5MGE3ZjU5M2EwYTM0NGU3M2IwZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commit/fe112acd5dae522d80f9a4ab42f476e422d8fb01","sha":"fe112acd5dae522d80f9a4ab42f476e422d8fb01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commits/fe112acd5dae522d80f9a4ab42f476e422d8fb01"}],"sha":"feff1d400fc675ac87c90a7f593a0a344e73b0fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commits/feff1d400fc675ac87c90a7f593a0a344e73b0fd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250864267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/skantdev","id":250864267,"login":"skantdev","node_id":"U_kgDODvPiiw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commits/fe112acd5dae522d80f9a4ab42f476e422d8fb01/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T21:12:37Z","email":"skant.dev1@gmail.com","name":"shashikant maurya"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T21:12:37Z","email":"skant.dev1@gmail.com","name":"shashikant maurya"},"message":"feat(init): enterprise e-commerce micro frontend platform with Turborepo and Module Federation\n\nInitialize monorepo structure with comprehensive architecture for scalable micro frontend application:\n\nInfrastructure (Step 1):\n- Turborepo 2.x monorepo with pnpm workspaces for efficient dependency management\n- Strict TypeScript 5.5+ configuration with comprehensive type safety\n- ESLint + Prettier for code quality and consistent formatting\n- Husky + Commitlint for enforcing conventional commits\n- VS Code workspace settings and recommended extensions\n\nHost Application (Step 2):\n- Vite 5.3+ with instant dev server and fast HMR (<50ms)\n- Module Federation for runtime micro frontend integration\n- React 19 with React Router 7 for modern routing\n- Redux Toolkit 2.x for state management (prepared)\n- Tailwind CSS 3.x for utility-first styling\n- Error boundaries and loading states for resilient UX\n- Responsive shell layout with header and footer\n\nDocumentation:\n- ARCHITECTURE.md: System design, micro frontend patterns, deployment strategy\n- RULES.md: Coding standards, folder structure, naming conventions\n- PROJECT_PLAN.md: 27-step roadmap with acceptance criteria\n- CONTRIBUTING.md: Developer onboarding and workflow guide\n- 4 ADRs: Architectural decisions for Turborepo, Module Federation, Redux, Vite\n\nPort Allocation:\n- Host: 3000 (running)\n- Auth: 3001, Home: 3002, Products: 3003, Cart: 3004\n- Checkout: 3005, Orders: 3006, Profile: 3007, Admin: 3008\n\nTech Stack:\n- React 19.0.0 + TypeScript 5.5.2\n- Vite 5.3.3 + @originjs/vite-plugin-federation 1.4.1\n- Redux Toolkit 2.2.5 + React Redux 9.1.2\n- React Router DOM 7.0.1\n- Tailwind CSS 3.4.17\n\nProgress: 2/27 steps complete (7.4%)\nNext: Step 3 - Create @repo/types package for shared TypeScript interfaces","tree":{"sha":"32104f89b9dd2c08fd6139c68e83801247cec63b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/git/trees/32104f89b9dd2c08fd6139c68e83801247cec63b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/git/commits/fe112acd5dae522d80f9a4ab42f476e422d8fb01","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250864267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/skantdev","id":250864267,"login":"skantdev","node_id":"U_kgDODvPiiw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skantdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commit/fe112acd5dae522d80f9a4ab42f476e422d8fb01","node_id":"C_kwDOTWd-D9oAKGZlMTEyYWNkNWRhZTUyMmQ4MGY5YTRhYjQyZjQ3NmU0MjJkOGZiMDE","parents":[],"sha":"fe112acd5dae522d80f9a4ab42f476e422d8fb01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commits/fe112acd5dae522d80f9a4ab42f476e422d8fb01"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/skantdev/ecommerce-micro-frontend/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=bc764709796c2514dd7cf72a2052c162f551854a&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%3A47%3A44.677Z"}');
