026-07-13T01:59:00Z","email":"user@example.com","name":"user"},"message":"Initial commit: frontend knowledge base with 42 topics across 10 levels\n\n- Level 1: Basic (event loop, CRP, code splitting, network security, workers)\n- Level 2: React Core (rendering, VDOM, Fiber, Concurrent, Server Components)\n- Level 3: Performance (layout thrashing, rendering pipeline, CSS containment)\n- Level 4: Data & State (structural sharing, immutable, FSM, event sourcing, optimistic)\n- Level 5: Caching & Networking (HTTP caching, HTTP/3, streams, cookies)\n- Level 6: Security (CSP, DOM attacks, SOP, SW lifecycle, offline conflicts)\n- Level 7: Web Platform (islands, web components, observers)\n- Level 8: Concurrency (task scheduling, WebRTC)\n- Level 9: Metrics (Core Web Vitals, Performance API, a11y)\n- Level 10: Architecture (edge, micro-frontends, WASM, system design)\n\n485 files across 42 topic directories","tree":{"sha":"c1f9f95fc1d68281ab4a5c1db66e6eca7b65d3dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iamVinhNT/frontend-knowledge-base/git/trees/c1f9f95fc1d68281ab4a5c1db66e6eca7b65d3dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iamVinhNT/frontend-knowledge-base/git/commits/b9bfd14f1b94d8d452d55d0cdd28cd5aa8be137d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7228420?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/superman32432432","id":7228420,"login":"superman32432432","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjg0MjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/