ail exception handling (404/400/409/503 register-down fallback)\n- JacksonConfig ObjectMapper; RestClient via static factory (SB4 modular autoconfig)\n- ProfileFlowIntegrationTest on Testcontainers PG18: create/read/refresh/fallback (5)","tree":{"sha":"ebbb60a2f479177121c6b0267e4dc054f8fa64b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indrekmaask/eis-profile/git/trees/ebbb60a2f479177121c6b0267e4dc054f8fa64b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indrekmaask/eis-profile/git/commits/c02dda8a2b6fe47be03f5d3a1e79ff69f053e856","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/indrekmaask/eis-profile/commit/c02dda8a2b6fe47be03f5d3a1e79ff69f053e856","node_id":"C_kwDOTW03vNoAKGMwMmRkYThhMmI2ZmU0N2JlMDNmNWQzYTFlNzlmZjY5ZjA1M2U4NTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/indrekmaask/eis-profile/commit/e9fd72b7dfa729b8c7e5d8eabe49052c6b2fd023","sha":"e9fd72b7dfa729b8c7e5d8eabe49052c6b2fd023","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indrekmaask/eis-profile/commits/e9fd72b7dfa729b8c7e5d8eabe49052c6b2fd023"}],"sha":"c02dda8a2b6fe47be03f5d3a1e79ff69f053e856","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indrekmaask/eis-profile/commits/c02dda8a2b6fe47be03f5d3a1e79ff69f053e856"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indrekmaask/eis-profile/commits/e9fd72b7dfa729b8c7e5d8eabe49052c6b2fd023/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T22:38:05Z","email":"indrek@srini.ee","name":"Indrek Maask"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T22:38:05Z","email":"indrek@srini.ee","name":"Indrek Maask"},"message":"feat: add register/CRM clients and BLL validation primitives\n\n- RegistryClient (RestClient): 404 -> empty, 5xx -> RegistryUnavailableException (fallback)\n- CrmClient extension point + NoOpCrmClient behind eis.crm.enabled (default off)\n- ValueResolver: effective-value priority USER > REGISTRY > CRM (merge on refresh)\n- validators: IBAN mod-97, Estonian person code checksum, market/region vocabulary\n- PersonCodeDeriver: birth date from personal code\n- ProfileCompletenessCalculator: 6-field unweighted \"täituvus\" checklist\n- BllLogicTest: 6 fast unit tests, all green","tree":{"sha":"6c0224f82ee994264a2ada15c64ba597eaee2c3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indrekmaask/eis-profile/git/trees/6c0224f82ee994264a2ada15c64ba597eaee2c3a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indrekmaask/eis-profile/git/commits/e9fd72b7dfa729b8c7e5d8eabe49052c6b2fd023","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/indrekmaask/eis-profile/commit/e9fd72b7dfa729b8c7e5d8eabe49052c6b2fd023","node_id":"C_kwDOTW03vNoAKGU5ZmQ3MmI3ZGZhNzI5YjhjN2U1ZDhlYWJlNDkwNTJjNmIyZmQwMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/indrekmaask/eis-profile/commit/b66dd64da5424cbd02895719beab12eec3d91c5c","sha":"b66dd64da5424cbd02895719beab12eec3d91c5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indrekmaask/eis-profile/commits/b66dd64da5424cbd02895719beab12eec3d91c5c"}],"sha":"e9fd72b7dfa729b8c7e5d8eabe49052c6b2fd023","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indrekmaask/eis-profile/commits/e9fd72b7dfa729b8c7e5d8eabe49052c6b2fd023"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indrekmaask/eis-profile/commits/b66dd64da5424cbd02895719beab12eec3d91c5c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T22:32:32Z","email":"indrek@srini.ee","name":"Indrek Maask"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T22:32:32Z","email":"indrek@srini.ee","name":"Indrek Maask"},"message":"feat: add central profile data model, migrations and repositories\n\n- Flyway V1-V11: 9 entities (customer_profile + market_region, contact_person,\n  bank_account, address, related_party, annual_report, profile_source_snapshot,\n  profile_access) with UUID PKs, FK cascade, CHECK/UNIQUE constraints, indexes,\n  updated_at trigger\n- per-field provenance (*_source: REGISTRY/CRM/USER); raw payloads in JSONB snapshot\n- seed V900: Biomarket (10966560) as a partial Scenario-1 profile\n- JPA entities + Spring Data repositories\n- DataModelTest on Testcontainers PostgreSQL 18: migrations apply, seed loads,\n  UNIQUE + FK-cascade enforced (3/3 green)\n- ERD.md (Mermaid) generated from the schema","tree":{"sha":"984dfb3edadf9ca2976ba52f127578e207fdc0ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indrekmaask/eis-profile/git/trees/984dfb3edadf9ca2976ba52f127578e207fdc0ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indrekmaask/eis-profile/git/commits/b66dd64da5424cbd02895719beab12eec3d91c5c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/indrekmaask/eis-profile/commit/b66dd64da5424cbd02895719beab12eec3d91c5c","node_id":"C_kwDOTW03vNoAKGI2NmRkNjRkYTU0MjRjYmQwMjg5NTcxOWJlYWIxMmVlYzNkOTFjNWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/indrekmaask/eis-profile/commit/f8e3ddf6a6f7ad5e08c46c106dc3d279fe4e2b7f","sha":"f8e3ddf6a6f7ad5e08c46c106dc3d279fe4e2b7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indrekmaask/eis-profile/commits/f8e3ddf6a6f7ad5e08c46c106dc3d279fe4e2b7f"}],"sha":"b66dd64da5424cbd02895719beab12eec3d91c5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indrekmaask/eis-profile/commits/b66dd64da5424cbd02895719beab12eec3d91c5c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indrekmaask/eis-profile/commits/f8e3ddf6a6f7ad5e08c46c106dc3d279fe4e2b7f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T22:32:23Z","email":"indrek@srini.ee","name":"Indrek Maask"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T22:32:23Z","email":"indrek@srini.ee","name":"Indrek Maask"},"message":"build: migrate backend from Maven to Gradle\n\n- Gradle 9.6.1 (Kotlin DSL) + Java 25 toolchain; wrapper committed\n- clean Lombok annotation processing on JDK 25 (Lombok 1.18.46)\n- Spring Boot 4 per-tech autoconfig modules (spring-boot-flyway);\n  Testcontainers 2.x renamed modules (testcontainers-postgresql)\n- multi-stage Dockerfile builds with gradle:9.6.1-jdk25","tree":{"sha":"f3f032229ca6ca2246ffce35be5b50c4cf46c771","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indrekmaask/eis-profile/git/trees/f3f032229ca6ca2246ffce35be5b50c4cf46c771"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indrekmaask/eis-profile/git/commits/f8e3ddf6a6f7ad5e08c46c106dc3d279fe4e2b7f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/indrekmaask/eis-profile/commit/f8e3ddf6a6f7ad5e08c46c106dc3d279fe4e2b7f","node_id":"C_kwDOTW03vNoAKGY4ZTNkZGY2YTZmN2FkNWUwOGM0NmMxMDZkYzNkMjc5ZmU0ZTJiN2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/indrekmaask/eis-profile/commit/808edff4fe79bac2fa53ef81cbf41d4244b2176c","sha":"808edff4fe79bac2fa53ef81cbf41d4244b2176c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indrekmaask/eis-profile/commits/808edff4fe79bac2fa53ef81cbf41d4244b2176c"}],"sha":"f8e3ddf6a6f7ad5e08c46c106dc3d279fe4e2b7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indrekmaask/eis-profile/commits/f8e3ddf6a6f7ad5e08c46c106dc3d279fe4e2b7f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indrekmaask/eis-profile/commits/808edff4fe79bac2fa53ef81cbf41d4244b2176c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T22:10:26Z","email":"indrek@srini.ee","name":"Indrek Maask"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T22:11:56Z","email":"indrek@srini.ee","name":"Indrek Maask"},"message":"refactor: vendor mock API instead of git submodule\n\n- replace external/business-profile-mock-api submodule with a pinned plain-file\n  copy (no nested .git), so a plain clone works without --recurse-submodules\n- remove .gitmodules; update README clone instructions","tree":{"sha":"fda7eee72bc31345758944c42a07297c027c784b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indrekmaask/eis-profile/git/trees/fda7eee72bc31345758944c42a07297c027c784b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/indrekmaask/eis-profile/git/commits/808edff4fe79bac2fa53ef81cbf41