rs","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-roles-usage/commits/5b5847c9c7040b114d17170d200a692ac228b39f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T08:15:53Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T08:15:53Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix: correct webpack config and recover true SCSS source\n\n- Federation container name is ''supportRolesUsage'' (camelCase) assigned to\n  appShell.remotes.supportRolesUsage; the hyphenated name broke Terser.\n- CSS Modules use localIdentName ''[local]'' (identity), matching the original\n  build (locals map was an identity map).\n- Share react/react-dom/apollo/moonstone/ui-extender/i18next as singletons with\n  import:false — provided by the Jahia app-shell at runtime (keeps the bundle lean).\n- Replace the SCSS placeholder with the real nested source recovered from the\n  css-loader module''s embedded source map.\n- Add yarn.lock produced by the reproducible build.\n\nVerified: mvn clean install succeeds; produced bundle (80 KB) and generated OSGi\nmanifest match the original artifact.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"b5171c14f963f67c542f45cd87085c5104487400","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-roles-usage/git/trees/b5171c14f963f67c542f45cd87085c5104487400"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/support-roles-usage/git/commits/5b5847c9c7040b114d17170d200a692ac228b39f","verification":{"payload":"tree b5171c14f963f67c542f45cd87085c5104487400\nparent 55bdc7bc73021fc6cbd674ebd646f9c027d9a6f9\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1783930553 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1783930553 +0200\n\nfix: correct webpack config and recover true SCSS source\n\n- Federation container name is ''supportRolesUsage'' (camelCase) assigned to\n  appShell.remotes.supportRolesUsage; the hyphenated name broke Terser.\n- CSS Modules use localIdentName ''[local]'' (identity), matching the original\n  build (locals map was an identity map).\n- Share react/react-dom/apollo/moonstone/ui-extender/i18next as singletons with\n  import:false — provided by the Jahia app-shell at runtime (keeps the bundle lean).\n- Replace the SCSS placeholder with the real nested source recovered from the\n  css-loader module''s embedded source map.\n- Add yarn.lock produced by the reproducible build.\n\nVerified: mvn clean install succeeds; produced bundle (80 KB) and generated OSGi\nmanifest match the original artifact.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmpUnrkACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3lOswf8D/OkWYYJCNhZIhLMZJLVgpWMJThKcdHRA4tTNQLDuWudCpwwMpNwszaq\nbT2TypWFIi3rMd1xKMc/SS3ABuF3qBpDl0d4PdhWcJuf4JuJXR868nJTE02uGQl0\nZY2QKDLCREbodkaggpL5WvNf3h9rXyXqWJN/6esAh5S+SwH/a/4O80QTje+TeeId\ncfm8//FrjfTBRUVNsu7H5iWKq0eaTPRUTKXG3MV5XiuL/ZItFZceFZkmyxjHvMQj\nIHa+0yxMtN+RphnI3uKG5sUahUR8JdOoF97K8xorGbpJzokV8Jk7AE61aX2dIAMU\nQzxks1TB5jioydT0rpcL3jTdUR7C7Q==\n=tTFl\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-13T08:56:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.gi