gtoming/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/dcpen/commits/16c2e2f809a69d52c45a32896138628a6eb73a3a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T01:08:46Z","email":"tomingtoming@gmail.com","name":"toming"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T01:08:46Z","email":"tomingtoming@gmail.com","name":"toming"},"message":"サムネイルを実シーンの演出ショットに刷新(アイテムv14)\n\n旧サムネはdevサーバの素のスクリーンショットで、マウスロック案内・\nクロスヘア等のDOMが写り込み、ペンも遠く殺風景だった。\n\n刷新の作り:\n- debugApi に inject(完成形ストロークの直接投入・dev専用)を追加し、\n  虹の「DcPen」手書き文字＋ハート/星/渦巻き/下線を舞台設営\n- dev.tsx プローブに __THREE を追加(撮影用カメラ・背景生成に使用)\n- 撮影は scripts/shoot-thumbnail.js: 実シーンに撮影用カメラで直接\n  gl.render→canvas.toDataURL(2560x1440)→lanczosで1280x720へ縮小。\n  床/グリッド/影を消しグラデ背景、フィルライト追加、虹ペンのクローンを\n  書き終わり位置に浮かせる演出\n- 本番挙動は不変(injectはdevのみ参照されるdebugApi経由・checkは29/29\n  APPROVE)。アイテムv14としてアップロード済み\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TpRG2watB63MUc5r4Vy5yx","tree":{"sha":"e09e5419e0da5a0d67f11beb9aa2fbafb5c9ef2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/dcpen/git/trees/e09e5419e0da5a0d67f11beb9aa2fbafb5c9ef2c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/dcpen/git/commits/16c2e2f809a69d52c45a32896138628a6eb73a3a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/469008?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/gists{/gist