579835/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T20:38:10Z","email":"tomingtoming@gmail.com","name":"toming"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T20:38:10Z","email":"tomingtoming@gmail.com","name":"toming"},"message":"VR: 握った手の回転にペンの向きが正しく追従しない問題の修正 v9候補\n\n真因=XRift本番はXRオリジン(カメラリグ)をアバター身長比(heightRatio)でscaleしており、\nrig = headWorld × headLocal⁻¹ に一様スケールが混入。Quaternion.setFromRotationMatrix\nは無スケール前提のため回転が歪む(位置はaffine合成で正確=v6では気づかず)。\nMatrix4.decomposeでスケールを除いた単位quaternionを取るよう修正。\n\n検証=iwerによるWebXRエミュレーションを?xrテストモードとしてdev.tsxに常設。\nscale0.8のリグ下で再現(|q|=0.84・90°ロールで軸ずれ)→修正後は理論値と完全一致(|q|=1)。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KmZBiB8i7LhyspivfnVsgz","tree":{"sha":"d5e07f1b59bd1ea614ed6b29fef7799fb93b73b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/dcpen/git/trees/d5e07f1b59bd1ea614ed6b29fef7799fb93b73b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/dcpen/git/commits/a60759bf6f6e06f7fd5982d205764e23e8579835","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/469008?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tomingtoming","id":469008,"login":"tomingtoming","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2OTAwOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomi