om/users/mewhhaha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mewhhaha","id":3399205,"login":"mewhhaha","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTkyMDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mewhhaha/v-frame/commits/370154f9429c662050c00cf233c490fd4ec0392e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T11:44:46Z","email":"kopatheonlyone@hotmail.com","name":"mewhhaha"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T11:44:46Z","email":"kopatheonlyone@hotmail.com","name":"mewhhaha"},"message":"Share one listener registry across the event bridges\n\nThe document facade, the window bridge and the native XHR patches each kept\ntheir own {type, listener, capture, wrapper} store, and had already drifted\napart on which of once/signal/dedupe they honoured. Move that bookkeeping into\nListenerRegistry and leave only the part each one actually does differently at\nthe call site: the facade''s synthetic eventPhase, the window bridge''s mirroring\nonto the shadow root, and the XHR patches'' teardown silencing plus fallback to\nthe native implementation for listeners the registry never saw.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2e14c95e7ddd791d892f1e4e718bfa7479a7e9ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mewhhaha/v-frame/git/trees/2e14c95e7ddd791d892f1e4e718bfa7479a7e9ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mewhhaha/v-frame/git/commits/370154f9429c662050c00cf233c490fd4ec0392e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3399205?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mewhhaha","id":3399205,"login":"mewhhaha","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTkyMDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mewhhaha/v-frame/commit/370154f9429c662050c00cf233c490fd4ec0392e","node_id":"C_kwDOTXHKBdoAKDM3MDE1NGY5NDI5YzY2MjA1MGMwMGNmMjMzYzQ5MGZkNGVjMDM5MmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mewhhaha/v-frame/commit/a5a944d16eb4200493ac4e037af7b1a3706b9091","sha":"a5a944d16eb4200493ac4e037af7b1a3706b9091","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mewhhaha/v-frame/commits/a5a944d16eb4200493ac4e037af7b1a3706b9091"}],"sha":"370154f9429c662050c00cf233c490fd4ec0392e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mewhhaha/v-frame/commits/370154f9429c662050c00cf233c490fd4ec0392e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3399205?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mewhhaha","id":3399205,"login":"mewhhaha","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTkyMDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mewhhaha/v-frame/commits/a5a944d16eb4200493ac4e037af7b1a3706b9091/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T11:35:50Z","email":"kopatheonlyone@hotmail.com","name":"mewhhaha"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T11:35:50Z","email":"kopatheonlyone@hotmail.com","name":"mewhhaha"},"message":"Delete the credentialless XHR transport\n\nThe 1,031-line XMLHttpRequest reimplementation existed only so that\ncredentials=\"omit\" could suppress same-origin cookies on guest XHRs. The\nguest is same-origin and trusted, so it can call fetch with omitted\ncredentials or read document.cookie whenever it likes: the mode was a\ncostume, not a boundary, and it cost a permanent spec-fidelity liability.\n\ncredentials now means what it can honestly mean — the mode of the entry\ndocument and stylesheet requests v-frame itself issues, plus the default\nfor guest requests that do not choose one. The README says so, and says\nplainly that it is not a security boundary. Native XHR keeps its\n\"include\" handling, which maps onto withCredentials and is still real.\n\nThe spec loses the seven cases that only exercised the deleted transport\n(response types, upload progress, document MIME parsing, progress\ntotals, open-argument validation, timeouts, abort/reopen transitions);\nwhat remains covers the entry and stylesheet credential modes, native\nXHR under same-origin and include, teardown suppression, and reentrant\ndisposal.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b3dff73cef63f32783e56c7a47046eed1a05d46e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mewhhaha/v-frame/git/trees/b3dff73cef63f32783e56c7a47046eed1a05d46e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mewhhaha/v-frame/git/commits/a5a944d16eb4200493ac4e037af7b1a3706b9091","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3399205?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mewhhaha","id":3399205,"login":"mewhhaha","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTkyMDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mewhhaha/v-frame/commit/a5a944d16eb4200493ac4e037af7b1a3706b9091","node_id":"C_kwDOTXHKBdoAKGE1YTk0NGQxNmViNDIwMDQ5M2FjNGUwMzdhZjdiMWEzNzA2YjkwOTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mewhhaha/v-frame/commit/5fd32acc5b3bd14b49d1ee1c5dca23db91ce0d61","sha":"5fd32acc5b3bd14b49d1ee1c5dca23db91ce0d61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mewhhaha/v-frame/commits/5fd32acc5b3bd14b49d1ee1c5dca23db91ce0d61"}],"sha":"a5a944d16eb4200493ac4e037af7b1a3706b9091","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mewhhaha/v-frame/commits/a5a944d16eb4200493ac4e037af7b1a3706b9091"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3399205?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mewhhaha","id":3399205,"login":"mewhhaha","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTkyMDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mewhhaha/v-frame/commits/5fd32acc5b3bd14b49d1ee1c5dca23db91ce0d61/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T11:28:28Z","email":"kopatheonlyone@hotmail.com","name":"mewhhaha"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T11:28:28Z","email":"kopatheonlyone@hotmail.com","name":"mewhhaha"},"message":"Ship the SSR materializer as v-frame/server\n\nThe recommended adopt path required every host to copy the materializer out of\nan example directory, including the CSS escape that keeps an imported string\nfrom closing the style element. Ship it instead: a runtime-neutral core that\nexposes the per-element decisions without parsing HTML, a Cloudflare\nHTMLRewriter adapter over it, and the stylesheet primitives a host on another\nruntime needs to write its own adapter.\n\nThe example now imports the package, which also proves the export resolves, and\nthe version drops to 0.1.0 because the package is unpublished and the planned\nbehaviour changes still come before a stable release.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"65af813c4520e99f6b28f5c107cf0ec316b954af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mewhhaha/v-frame/git/trees/65af813c4520e99f6b28f5c107cf0ec316b954af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mewhhaha/v-frame/git/commits/5fd32acc5b3bd14b49d1ee1c5dca23db91ce0d61","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3399205?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mewhhaha","id":3399205,"login":"mewhhaha","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTkyMDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mewhhaha/v-frame/commit/5fd32acc5b3bd14b49d1ee1c5dca23db91ce0d61","node_id":"C_kwDOTXHKBdoAKDVmZDMyYWNjNWIzYmQxNGI0OWQxZWUxYzVkY2EyM2RiOTFjZTBkNjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mewhhaha/v-frame/commit/c2c7f523ebf9c7a884e17f362a0f4593d09cb66a","sha":"c2c7f523ebf9c7a884e17f362a0f4593d09cb66a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mewhhaha/v-frame/commits/c2c7f523ebf9c7a884e17f362a0f4593d09cb66a"}],"sha":"5fd32acc5b3bd14b49d1ee1c5dca23db91ce0d61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mewhhaha/v-frame/commits/5fd32acc5b3bd14b49d1ee1c5dca23db91ce0d61"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3399205?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mewhhaha","id":3399205,"login":"mewhhaha","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTkyMDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mewhhaha/v-frame/commits/c2c7f523ebf9c7a884e17f362a0f4593d09cb66a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T11:17:36Z","email":"kopatheonlyone@hotmail.com","name":"mewhhaha"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T11:17:36Z","email":"kopatheonlyone@hotmail.com","name":"mewhhaha"},"message":"Halve the payload with css-tree subpaths and a minified build\n\ncss-tree''s package entry pulls in the lexer and its 81 KB syntax-definition\ntable, which nothing here calls: the only APIs used are parse, generate and\nwalk. Import them from the css-tree/parser, css-tree/generator and\ncss-tree/walker subpaths instead, which build on the same createParser /\ncreateGenerator / createWalker factories and therefore produce identical ASTs\nand output for the explicit options every call site already passes.\n@types/css-tree declares only the package root, so a local ambient module\nborrows the root signatures to keep the call sites typed.\n\nMinify both bundles as well, so a consumer loading dist/index.js directly pays\nminified bytes. keepNames is deliberately off: it would cost 4.9 KB gzip to\npreserve identifiers that only appear in stack traces, and the sourcemap\nalready covers that.\n\nThe contract test asserted the registered constructor''s own `name`, which\nminification mangles. It now asserts the properties that are actually the\ncontract - the element is registered, it subclasses HTMLElement, and the\nside-effect entry, the named export and defineVFrame() all yield one\nconstructor.\n\nBundle gzip drops from 97,514 to 64,727 bytes (minified 341 KB to 216 KB); the\nsize budget is ratcheted from 100,000 to 66,000.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"15f97c85a56830f809dbc28c48bd76b22c44bae1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mewhhaha/v-frame/git/trees/15f97c85a56830f809dbc28c48bd76b22c44bae1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mewhhaha/v-frame/git/commits/c2c7f523ebf9c7a884e17f362a0f4593d09cb66a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3399205?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mewhhaha","id":3399205,"login":"mewhhaha","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTkyMDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mewhhaha/v-frame/commit/c2c7f523ebf9c7a884e17f362a0f4593d09cb66a","node_id":"C_kwDOTXHKBdoAKGMyYzdmNTIzZWJmOWM3YTg4NGUxN2YzNjJhMGY0NTkzZDA5Y2I2NmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mewhhaha/v-frame/commit/68abb314f8ea8462112bf844ff3a91d2982f22a0","sha":"68abb314f8ea8462112bf844ff3a91d2982f22a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mewhhaha/v-frame/commits/68abb314f8ea8462112bf844ff3a91d2982f22a0"}],"sha":"c2c7f523ebf9c7a884e17f362a0f4593d09cb66a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mewhhaha/v-frame/commits/c2c7f523ebf9c7a884e17f362a0f4593d09cb66a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3399205?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mewhhaha","id":3399205,"login":"mewhhaha","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTkyMDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mewhhaha/v-frame/commits/68abb314f8ea8462112bf844ff3a91d2982f22a0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T11:12:05Z","email":"kopatheonlyone@hotmail.com","name":"mewhhaha"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T11:12:05Z","email":"kopatheonlyone@hotmail.com","name":"mewhhaha"},"message":"Freeze the house style with Biome formatting\n\nBiome''s formatter is configured to reproduce what the code already looked\nlike — two-space indent, double quotes, semicolons, trailing commas, a\n90-column budget — rather than to impose a new style. Widths from 80 to 120\nwere compared against the working tree and 90 tracked the existing wrapping\nmost closely.\n\nThe formatter runs over everything git tracks except dist, node_modules,\ngenerated files and the lockfile; the linter and the import assist stay off\nso this commit carries no semantic change. Verified by rebuilding src/ from\nHEAD and from the reformatted tree with esbuild --minify: the two bundles are\nbyte-identical.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2ccb5bb384dbc664de4cb962568a7688dc5f2baa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mewhhaha/v-frame/git/trees/2ccb5bb384dbc664de4cb962568a7688dc5f2baa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mewhhaha/v-frame/git/commits/68abb314f8ea8462112bf844ff3a91d2982f22a0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3399205?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mewhhaha","id":3399205,"login":"mewhhaha","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTkyMDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mewhhaha/v-frame/commit/68abb314f8ea8462112bf844ff3a91d2982f22a0","node_id":"C_kwDOTXHKBdoAKDY4YWJiMzE0ZjhlYTg0NjIxMTJiZjg0NGZmM2E5MWQyOTgyZjIyYTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mewhhaha/v-frame/commit/d2cd657b4de3ef49b2e7ca51d4329504776cd9cd","sha":"d2cd657b4de3ef49b2e7ca51d4329504776cd9cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mewhhaha/v-frame/commits/d2cd657b4de3ef49b2e7ca51d4329504776cd9cd"}],"sha":"68abb314f8ea8462112bf844ff3a91d2982f22a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mewhhaha/v-frame/commits/68abb314f8ea8462112bf844ff3a91d2982f22a0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3399205?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mewhhaha","id":3399205,"login":"mewhhaha","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTkyMDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mewhhaha/v-frame/commits/d2cd657b4de3ef49b2e7ca51d4329504776cd9cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T11:06:11Z","email":"kopatheonlyone@hotmail.com","name":"mewhhaha"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T11:06:11Z","email":"kopatheonlyone@hotmail.com","name":"mewhhaha"},"message":"Untrack generated Cloudflare worker types\n\nThe five examples/ssr/apps/*/worker-configuration.d.ts files were 73,538\nlines, 63% of everything tracked here, and they pin a workerd date-version\nthat conflicts on every wrangler bump. Ignore them and have each app''s\nbuild run its existing `types` script first, so a fresh clone regenerates\nthem before anything reads them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"21a40801754136984d989f32ec984f67d7903885","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mewhhaha/v-frame/git/trees/21a40801754136984d989f32ec984f67d7903885"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mewhhaha/v-frame/git/commits/d2cd657b4de3ef49b2e7ca51d4329504776cd9cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3399205?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mewhhaha","id":3399205,"login":"mewhhaha","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTkyMDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mewhhaha/v-frame/commit/d2cd657b4de3ef49b2e7ca51d4329504776cd9cd","node_id":"C_kwDOTXHKBdoAKGQyY2Q2NTdiNGRlM2VmNDliMmU3Y2E1MWQ0MzI5NTA0Nzc2Y2Q5Y2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mewhhaha/v-frame/commit/fc12b0a9f828b3bda639db925b8a37995dc4f435","sha":"fc12b0a9f828b3bda639db925b8a37995dc4f435","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mewhhaha/v-frame/commits/fc12b0a9f828b3bda639db925b8a37995dc4f435"}],"sha":"d2cd657b4de3ef49b2e7ca51d4329504776cd9cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mewhhaha/v-frame/commits/d2cd657b4de3ef49b2e7ca51d4329504776cd9cd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3399205?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mewhhaha","id":3399205,"login":"mewhhaha","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTkyMDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mewhhaha/v-frame/commits/fc12b0a9f828b3bda639db925b8a37995dc4f435/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T11:03:48Z","email":"kopatheonlyone@hotmail.com","name":"mewhhaha"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T11:03:48Z","email":"kopatheonlyone@hotmail.com","name":"mewhhaha"},"message":"Gate the tree with CI, typechecked tests, and a size budget\n\nAdd a GitHub Actions workflow that typechecks, builds, measures the bundle\nand runs the Playwright suite on chromium and firefox.\n\nTypecheck the specs through a second project. tsconfig.json scopes itself to\nsrc for declaration emit, so tests/ and examples/*/shared/ have never been\nchecked; tsconfig.test.json covers them and every error it surfaced is fixed\nin place. materialize-v-frame.ts is excluded because it is Workers code that\nonly typechecks against the generated worker types, which its own app project\nalready does.\n\nAdd scripts/bundle-size.mjs so payload regressions fail CI instead of landing\nsilently. The budget starts at 100 KB against today''s 97,514 gzip bytes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bbec079f0e5c8cf29545830d6e3371a621eb3981","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mewhhaha/v-frame/git/trees/bbec079f0e5c8cf29545830d6e3371a621eb3981"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mewhhaha/v-frame/git/commits/fc12b0a9f828b3bda639db925b8a37995dc4f435","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3399205?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mewhhaha","id":3399205,"login":"mewhhaha","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTkyMDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mewhhaha","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mewhhaha/v-frame/commit/fc12b0a9f828b3bda639db925b8a37995dc4f435","node_id":"C_kwDOTXHKBdoAKGZjMTJiMGE5ZjgyOGIzYmRhNjM5ZGI5MjViOGEzNzk5NWRjNGY0MzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mewhhaha/v-f