e":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/oliweb-ch/wp-html-mail/commit/affd2ebe29ae38c77f81567fd96b27cc395e1cc9","node_id":"C_kwDOTXRNsNoAKGFmZmQyZWJlMjlhZTM4Yzc3ZjgxNTY3ZmQ5NmIyN2NjMzk1ZTFjYzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/oliweb-ch/wp-html-mail/commit/2a85f0d4400452a9f14f3a8328f12571f8c89cc0","sha":"2a85f0d4400452a9f14f3a8328f12571f8c89cc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oliweb-ch/wp-html-mail/commits/2a85f0d4400452a9f14f3a8328f12571f8c89cc0"}],"sha":"affd2ebe29ae38c77f81567fd96b27cc395e1cc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oliweb-ch/wp-html-mail/commits/affd2ebe29ae38c77f81567fd96b27cc395e1cc9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oliweb-ch/wp-html-mail/commits/2a85f0d4400452a9f14f3a8328f12571f8c89cc0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T07:34:23Z","email":"olivier+dev-server@petrucciani.net","name":"Olivier Petrucciani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T07:34:23Z","email":"olivier+dev-server@petrucciani.net","name":"Olivier Petrucciani"},"message":"Sécurité : échappement contextuel des sorties HTML des emails\n\n- esc_url() sur src de l''image header (attribut URL)\n- esc_attr() sur l''attribut alt de l''image header\n- esc_url(get_home_url()) sur les deux wrappers <a href> du header\n  (image liée et texte lié)\n- esc_html() sur {#mailsubject#} injecté dans le template HTML\n- wp_kses_post() sur la valeur footer avant remplacement dans le template\n  (second niveau de protection après strip_tags() à la sauvegarde)\n\nPrincipe : sanitize/validate à l''entrée ET escape au point de sortie.","tree":{"sha":"a569b9883e30048332be3b387b7ba3aa594c0036","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oliweb-ch/wp-html-mail/git/trees/a569b9883e30048332be3b387b7ba3aa594c0036"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oliweb-ch/wp-html-mail/git/commits/2a85f0d4400452a9f14f3a8328f12571f8c89cc0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/oliweb-ch/wp-html-mail/commit/2a85f0d4400452a9f14f3a8328f12571f8c89cc0","node_id":"C_kwDOTXRNsNoAKDJhODVmMGQ0NDAwNDUyYTlmMTRmM2E4MzI4ZjEyNTcxZjhjODljYzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/oliweb-ch/wp-html-mail/commit/f7df7b02fda649594195a49af25b0a104818bae3","sha":"f7df7b02fda649594195a49af25b0a104818bae3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oliweb-ch/wp-html-mail/commits/f7df7b02fda649594195a49af25b0a104818bae3"}],"sha":"2a85f0d4400452a9f14f3a8328f12571f8c89cc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oliweb-ch/wp-html-mail/commits/2a85f0d4400452a9f14f3a8328f12571f8c89cc0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oliweb-ch/wp-html-mail/commits/f7df7b02fda649594195a49af25b0a104818bae3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T07:29:58Z","email":"olivier+dev-server@petrucciani.net","name":"Olivier Petrucciani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T07:29:58Z","email":"olivier+dev-server@petrucciani.net","name":"Olivier Petrucciani"},"message":"Sécurité : correction de 3 vulnérabilités identifiées par audit\n\n- save_theme_settings() (REST) : appel manquant de validate_theme_options()\n  avant update_option() — les données POST étaient sauvegardées brutes.\n  validate_theme_options() est passée de private à public pour être accessible\n  depuis class-template-designer.php.\n\n- process_admin_page_actions() : ajout de check_admin_referer() avant\n  l''exécution des actions avancées (delete-design, delete-all,\n  create-template-file) déclenchées via $_GET sans vérification de nonce\n  (CSRF). Les URLs correspondantes sont maintenant générées avec wp_nonce_url().\n\n- create_custom_template() : chmod 0777 → 0644 sur le fichier template.html\n  créé dans le répertoire du thème.","tree":{"sha":"4e39c38a010ec90802dc4529c464ad4ca6259615","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oliweb-ch/wp-html-mail/git/trees/4e39c38a010ec90802dc4529c464ad4ca6259615"},