"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150323342?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AriqueAhsan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AriqueAhsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AriqueAhsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AriqueAhsan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AriqueAhsan","id":150323342,"login":"AriqueAhsan","node_id":"U_kgDOCPXAjg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AriqueAhsan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AriqueAhsan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AriqueAhsan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AriqueAhsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AriqueAhsan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AriqueAhsan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AriqueAhsan/AriqueAhsan/commits/12ac2f26341e00e92a55f8f49b0889a5b268ed85/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T16:16:03Z","email":"150323342+AriqueAhsan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Arique"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T16:16:03Z","email":"150323342+AriqueAhsan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Arique"},"message":"Refresh chart data and resync copy with the portfolio\n\nThe assets here were still the 13 July build, so the chart showed\nJun 2026 / 1,261 / 2,001 / 643 while the pipeline had been re-run on\n31 July. Rebuilt from current contribution data.\n\n- Chart now reads Dec 2021 - Jul 2026, 1,278 softwrd commits, 2,018 total.\n- build-chart.mjs derived the SVG aria-label from a hardcoded month, so it\n  said \"June 2026\" while the visible badge said Jul. It now comes from the\n  same data as the badge and will not drift again.\n- Dropped the PR merge rate card: a high merge rate is what normal process\n  looks like, not an achievement. Still printed to stdout on each run.\n- Featured-work cards no longer quote bare commit shares and counts; they\n  name what was owned instead, matching the portfolio and CV.\n- Intro replaced with the current positioning, \"2.5+ years\" fixed, and\n  PropCloud''s org and user figures reworded so they read as the product''s\n  reach rather than as outcomes caused by my features.\n- Added a link to the portfolio''s evidence appendix, where the full\n  contribution record lives with per-product team sizes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"82e5e73a4cf7d15dd1f27f83fda70a439d1313ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AriqueAhsan/AriqueAhsan/git/trees/82e5e73a4cf7d15dd1f27f83fda70a439d1313ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AriqueAhsan/AriqueAhsan/git/commits/12ac2f26341e00e92a55f8f49b0889a5b268ed85","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150323342?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AriqueAhsan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AriqueAhsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AriqueAhsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AriqueAhsan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AriqueAhsan","id":150323342,"login":"AriqueAhsan","node_id":"U_kgDOCPXAjg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AriqueAhsan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AriqueAhsan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AriqueAhsan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AriqueAhsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AriqueAhsan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AriqueAhsan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AriqueAhsan/AriqueAhsan/commit/12ac2