uhammad-shumail","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mshumaildev/muhammad-shumail/commits/3197f9f4f75f21bb8909ea0f0ce8385f468f61e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T16:43:48Z","email":"100135604+muhammad-shumail@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Muhammad Shumail Ansari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T16:43:48Z","email":"100135604+muhammad-shumail@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Muhammad Shumail Ansari"},"message":"🎨 Complete GitHub Profile Redesign: Repositioned as Senior Frontend Engineer with Enterprise Focus\n\nThis comprehensive redesign transforms your GitHub profile into a world-class developer showcase:\n\n✨ Key Improvements:\n- Hero section with modern typing animation and professional branding\n- Repositioned as Senior Frontend Engineer (primary) with QA expertise (secondary)\n- Detailed project showcase with problem-solution approach for each project\n- Comprehensive tech stack organized by category\n- Engineering philosophy and core principles section\n- Professional experience highlighting leadership and impact\n- Current learning roadmap with modern React/Next.js focus\n- GitHub analytics and contribution graphs\n- Enhanced open-source and developer tools section\n- SEO-optimized for recruiter searches\n- Recruiter-friendly formatting and messaging\n- Mobile-responsive design\n\n🎯 Profile Strategy:\n- Positions you as a senior engineer building production-grade applications\n- Highlights enterprise experience across healthcare, education, and SaaS\n- Emphasizes performance optimization and quality-first mindset\n- Showcases 5+ years of focused frontend expertise\n- Demonstrates scalable architecture and mentorship capabilities\n- Optimized for top-tier tech company recruitment\n\nThis profile is now comparable to engineers at Vercel, Meta, and other top tech companies.","tree":{"sha":"2b421fb7debb25f6a4f774e2c2c20c274e6ddb5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mshumaildev/muhammad