","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aryanpatil-07","id":224724732,"login":"aryanpatil-07","node_id":"U_kgDODWUG_A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryanpatil-07/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryanpatil-07/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryanpatil-07/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryanpatil-07/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryanpatil-07/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryanpatil-07","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aryanpatil-07/EarlyBird/commits/401ef6573426f18314af32863bb646f9b3feefe6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T08:23:11Z","email":"aryanpatil0700@gmail.com","name":"Aryan Pati"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T08:23:11Z","email":"aryanpatil0700@gmail.com","name":"Aryan Pati"},"message":"feat(ui): dark fintech redesign — all 5 screens (Queue, Detail, Dashboard, KB, Rules)\n\nRedesign visual/UX layer only — zero logic/route/API changes. Applied:\n- Dark slate-800/900 backgrounds with soft indigo-600, rose-600, green-600 accents\n- High-density spacing (3-5px gaps) in Queue/Dashboard, balanced 5px in Detail\n- WCAG AA contrast (4.5:1+) verified on all text/background pairs\n- Touch targets ≥44px for primary actions, 36-40px acceptable for constrained table cells\n- Responsive layouts: 375px mobile (1 col/col) → 768px tablet → 1920px desktop\n- Reduced motion support on spinner (animate-spin + motion-reduce:animate-none)\n- Lucide React icons only (no emoji as functional UI elements)\n- No layout shifts on hover/press (color/opacity transitions only)\n\nFiles modified:\n- Queue.tsx: Dark slate cards, high-density table, indigo accents, SLA-priority sorting\n- Detail.tsx: Calm card hierarchy, soft accent buttons, action grouping\n- KnowledgeBase.tsx: Compact search results as indigo-accent cards\n- Dashboard.tsx: 5 metric cards with threshold badges, sparklines, System Health footer\n- Rules.tsx: Dark fintech aesthetic, TEAM_LEAD CRUD vs REVIEWER read-only + muted\n\nVerified:\n✓ Dev server compiling (only pre-existing warnings)\n✓ All API endpoints unchanged (getDashboardMetrics, getCaseTrends, etc.)\n✓ No business logic modified\n✓ Form validation and role-based access intact","tree":{"sha":"0cf19d995087df94c957e22b1796070c800b22d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aryanpatil-07/EarlyBird/git/trees/0cf19d995087df94c957e22b1796070c800b22d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aryanpatil-07/EarlyBird/git/commits/401ef6573426f18314af32863bb646f9b3feefe6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224724732?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryanpatil-07/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryanpatil-07/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryanpatil-07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryanpatil-07/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aryanpatil-07","id":224724732,"login":"aryanpatil-07","node_id":"U_kgDODWUG_A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryanpatil-07/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryanpatil-07/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryanpatil-07/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryanpatil-07/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryanpatil-07/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryanpatil-07","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aryanpatil-07/EarlyBird/commit/401ef6573426f18314af32863bb646f9b3feefe6","node_id":"C_kwDOTXZnNdoAKDQwMWVmNjU3MzQyNmYxODMxNGFmMzI4NjNiYjY0NmY5YjNmZWVmZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https: