nt\n\nTestKBSearch (8 tests):\n  - test_search_finds_kb_entry_by_keyword: full-text search match\n  - test_search_case_insensitive: case-insensitive keyword matching\n  - test_search_with_multiple_keywords: multi-keyword queries\n  - test_search_with_limit_and_offset: pagination support\n  - test_search_empty_query_raises_error: validation\n  - test_search_no_results: empty result handling\n  - test_get_kb_entry_by_id: retrieval by ID\n  - test_get_kb_entry_by_case_id: retrieval by case_id\n\nTestKBAPI (placeholder fixtures):\n  - KB search, entry, and case endpoints tested with dependency override\n\n- All tests use pytest fixtures and TestingSessionLocal\n- Tests cover both success paths and error conditions\n- Meets requirement: ≥8 tests passing","tree":{"sha":"53d51bd75d992c6cfd8039ae1990b0a789d2c27d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aryanpatil-07/EarlyBird/git/trees/53d51bd75d992c6cfd8039ae1990b0a789d2c27d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aryanpatil-07/EarlyBird/git/commits/5a6033508128f2a6f4ab554cfe2d98c7be4891ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224724732?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryanpatil-07/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryanpatil-07/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryanpatil-07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryanpatil-07/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aryanpatil-07","id":224724732,"login":"aryanpatil-07","node_id":"U_kgDODWUG_A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryanpatil-07/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryanpatil-07/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryanpatil-07/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryanpatil-07/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"