tech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/evanwillistech","id":292295840,"login":"evanwillistech","node_id":"U_kgDOEWwUoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evanwillistech/Kiosk-AI-Agent-Avatar-Tavus/commits/7da6ab8b09ac022a25512e9879a945d3dec75aae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T18:53:58Z","email":"evanwillistech@outlook.com","name":"evanwillistech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T18:53:58Z","email":"evanwillistech@outlook.com","name":"evanwillistech"},"message":"Blur clinic logo and contact info in idle screenshot\n\nRedact ''All Nassau Dental'' logo and footer (address/phone/website)\nfrom docs/screenshot-idle.jpg shown in the README.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"79c4304ba0d9350d9212fce7f9f5f00fcd3bdb98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evanwillistech/Kiosk-AI-Agent-Avatar-Tavus/git/trees/79c4304ba0d9350d9212fce7f9f5f00fcd3bdb98"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evanwillistech/Kiosk-AI-Agent-Avatar-Tavus/git/commits/7da6ab8b09ac022a25512e9879a945d3dec75aae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/292295840?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/evanwillistech","id":292295840,"login":"evanwillistech","node_id":"U_kgDOEWwUoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/evanwillistech/Kiosk-AI-Agent-Avatar-Tavus/commit/7da6ab8b09ac022a25512e9879a945d3dec75aae","node_id":"C_kwDOTXavCdoAKDdkYTZhYjhiMDlhYzAyMmEyNTUxMmU5ODc5YTk0NWQzZGVjNzVhYWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/evanwillistech/Kiosk-AI-Agent-Avatar-Tavus/commit/25560697229fab57eac47aa73330373d8ef78135","sha":"25560697229fab57eac47aa73330373d8ef78135","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evanwillistech/Kiosk-AI-Agent-Avatar-Tavus/commits/25560697229fab57eac47aa73330373d8ef78135"}],"sha":"7da6ab8b09ac022a25512e9879a945d3dec75aae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evanwillistech/Kiosk-AI-Agent-Avatar-Tavus/commits/7da6ab8b09ac022a25512e9879a945d3dec75aae"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evanwillistech/Kiosk-AI-Agent-Avatar-Tavus/commits/25560697229fab57eac47aa73330373d8ef78135/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-28T19:27:52Z","email":"berikizmaganov1990@gmail.com","name":"Tim Hunt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-28T19:27:52Z","email":"berikizmaganov1990@gmail.com","name":"Tim Hunt"},"message":"Fix prod boot stability + cloudflared HTTPS routing\n\nSymptoms before fix:\n- Backend crashed in a port-bind loop on boot (address already in use)\n  because both pm2-user.service and startup.sh ran pm2 resurrect.\n- Frontend bundle baked VITE_API_URL=http://<lan-ip>:8000, so the same\n  build broke when accessed via https://nassau-dental.face2.me (mixed\n  content + unreachable private IP).\n- Service worker was cache-first on hashed assets, so users got stuck on\n  a stale broken bundle after rebuilds.\n- SW catch-handler returned undefined when fetch failed and cache missed,\n  showing as ServiceWorker intercepted...unexpected error in browsers.\n- SW also tried to cache.put() ranged responses for jenny-idle.mp4\n  (HTML5 video), which rejects and broke playback.\n\nChanges:\n\necosystem.config.cjs\n  Use ./venv/bin/uvicorn directly with interpreter:none. The previous\n  \"uvicorn\" + interpreter:python3 form fell back to system python3 and\n  missed deps installed in the venv.\n\nfrontend/vite.config.js\n  Guard fs.readFileSync of dev TLS certs behind fs.existsSync so prod\n  builds (which do not ship localhost+2 certs) do not crash at startup.\n\nfrontend/public/sw.js\n  - bump CACHE_NAME to kiosk-v5\n  - skip /api/, /tools/, /ws (live, never cache)\n  - pass through Range requests (HTML5 video and audio)\n  - cache-first for /assets/* (Vite hashes the filename so it is safe)\n  - network-first for everything else with proper offline 503 fallback\n  - skipWaiting + clients.claim so updates take effect on next visit\n\nstart.sh\n  No more pm2 kill && pm2 start. Use pm2 startOrReload + pm2 save so\n  reruns are idempotent and never race with pm2-user.service.\n  Build with VITE_API_URL= (same-origin), reload nginx instead of\n  doing nothing about the static layer.\n\nstartup.sh\n  Strip everything that systemd already owns (nginx, pm2, cloudflared)\n  and the inline TUNNEL_TOKEN. Token now lives in /etc/cloudflared/env\n  (root:root 0600) consumed by the new cloudflared.service unit.\n  Boot script keeps only the legacy ssh fallback so we never lock\n  ourselves out.","tree":{"sha":"718c8306e348d867f9fc7ba80e768308829e6ea7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evanwillistech/Kiosk-AI-Agent-Avatar-Tavus/git/trees/718c8306e348d867f9fc7ba80e768308829e6ea7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evanwillistech/Kiosk-AI-Agent-Avatar-Tavus/git/commits/25560697229fab57eac47aa73330373d8ef78135","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/evanwillistech/Kiosk-AI-Agent-Avatar-Tavus/commit/25560697229fab57eac47aa73330373d8ef78135","node_id":"C_kwDOTXavCdoAKDI1NTYwNjk3MjI5ZmFiNTdlYWM0N2FhNzMzMzAzNzNkOGVmNzgxMzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/evanwillistech/Kiosk-AI-Agent-Avatar-Tavus/commit/4561e5a87291c8603dbdda42002c94dde28a1d15","sha":"4561e5a87291c8603dbdda42002c94dde28a1d15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evanwillistech/Kiosk-AI-Agent-Avatar-Tavus/commits/4561e5a87291c8603dbdda42002c94dde28a1d15"}],"sha":"25560697229fab57eac47aa73330373d8ef78135","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evanwillistech/Kiosk-AI-Agent-Avatar-Tavus/commits/25560697229fab57eac47aa73330373d8ef78135"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/292295840?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/evanwillistech","id":292295840,"login":"evanwillistech","node_id":"U_kgDOEWwUoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evanwillistech/Kiosk-AI-Agent-Avatar-Tavus/commits/4561e5a87291c8603dbdda42002c94dde28a1d15/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T19:03:48Z","email":"evanwillistech@outlook.com","name":"evanwillistech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T19:03:48Z","email":"evanwillistech@outlook.com","name":"evanwillistech"},"message":"Switch to Sparrow-1 turn detection, disable interruptions\n\nReplace deprecated STT turn-taking params with conversational_flow layer:\n- turn_detection_model: sparrow-1 (AI-based, better noise vs speech)\n- replica_interruptibility: low (Jenny finishes speaking, ignores noise)\n- turn_taking_patience: low (fast responses)\n- Remove deprecated: smart_turn_detection, participant_pause/interrupt_sensitivity\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8fdea052932d02ae994270b732ab8f5a3d07f93c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evanwillistech/Kiosk-AI-Agent-Avatar-Tavus/git/trees/8fdea052932d02ae994270b732ab8f5a3d07f93c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evanwillistech/Kiosk-AI-Agent-Avatar-Tavus/git/commits/4561e5a87291c8603dbdda42002c94dde28a1d15","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/292295840?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/evanwillistech","id":29229584