"name":"evanwillistech"},"message":"Full booking flow, staff panel, production hardening, updated README\n\n- Booking: procedure picker, time slots, appointment creation (voice + touch)\n- New patient registration: conversational collection of name/DOB/phone/insurance\n- Check-in: records arrival in Open Dental via voice or tap\n- Staff panel: waiting queue, patient notes, booking search, PIN re-lock\n- Error boundary: React crash recovery with restart button\n- WebRTC reconnect: auto-rejoin on network blips (3 attempts)\n- Touch targets: all buttons min 48x48px for kiosk touchscreen\n- Tap debouncing: prevents double-booking from rapid taps\n- Tool call timeout: 15s with user-facing error feedback\n- Session persistence: survives page refresh via sessionStorage\n- Inactivity: now tracks taps in addition to speech\n- Speech queue: tool results queued while avatar speaks\n- Activity bar: enter/exit animations, tool-specific labels\n- Panel switching: one panel at a time, dashboard auto-minimizes\n- Transcript: dynamic positioning above visible panel\n- README: full rewrite with deployment guide, nginx, cloudflare tunnel","tree":{"sha":"ea30f3768f716ead1e0d21fbd1581bda345d994c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evanwillistech/Kiosk-AI-Agent-Avatar-Tavus/git/trees/ea30f3768f716ead1e0d21fbd1581bda345d994c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evanwillistech/Kiosk-AI-Agent-Avatar-Tavus/git/commits/cfee6390c32e8801f986d7e6f950572db4337268","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/292295840?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.c