evanwillistech"},"message":"AI dental kiosk with Tavus CVI avatar, Open Dental integration, and fuzzy patient matching\n\nFull-stack patient check-in system for All Nassau Dental featuring:\n- Conversational AI avatar (Emma) via Tavus CVI + Daily.co WebRTC\n- 3-tier fuzzy name matching (exact → SOUNDEX → difflib)\n- Real-time patient dashboard with balance, appointments, and one-tap check-in\n- Multilingual support (EN/ES/RU)\n- Staff manual check-in sidebar\n- HIPAA audit logging\n- Twilio SMS reminders","tree":{"sha":"661fbd18fbd978c1eac4ef4e197efd32014c67e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evanwillistech/Kiosk-AI-Agent-Avatar-Tavus/git/trees/661fbd18fbd978c1eac4ef4e197efd32014c67e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evanwillistech/Kiosk-AI-Agent-Avatar-Tavus/git/commits/ab3e2fe3219287b1fcbe50532300ce3d6cc153cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/292295840?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/evanwillistech","id":292295840,"login":"evanwillistech","node_id":"U_kgDOEWwUoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanwillistech","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/evanwillistech/Kio