en\nthe plugin is deployed to a different namespace.\n\nThe BFF now exposes its own namespace via GET /api/config (injected by\nthe Helm chart through the Kubernetes Downward API), and the frontend\nfetches it at runtime instead of relying on a build-time constant.\n\nAlso fixes sync-chart-version.js regex to handle YAML comment lines\nin chart/values.yaml.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6ac5c6f81df722d329b9f66ca202f1046e842928","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/git/trees/6ac5c6f81df722d329b9f66ca202f1046e842928"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/git/commits/cd95d2a7613033e0aeca2a349ac3ba48ef89dcf8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3944034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimou","id":3944034,"login":"guimou","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDQwMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/commit/cd95d2a7613033e0aeca2a349ac3ba48ef89dcf8","node_id":"C_kwDOTXi2CNoAKGNkOTVkMmE3NjEzMDMzZTBhZWNhMmEzNDlhYzNiYTQ4ZWY4OWRjZjg"