dSettings\nuseEffect, passes the signal to the storageService call, and aborts\non cleanup. Aborted requests are silently ignored to prevent stale\nresponses from racing on rapid project switches.\n\nCloses #143\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(settings): guard setLoading against aborted signal in finally blocks\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8b1f9293b51388cc545a29a16440877404651cb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/git/trees/8b1f9293b51388cc545a29a16440877404651cb3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/git/commits/45953761ec0565e69888a83f32678f86fe9e1092","verification":{"payload":"tree 8b1f9293b51388cc545a29a16440877404651cb3\nparent d55318ebda626482dfbffff1d2ddf50ae3412d36\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784157590 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784157590 +0100\n\nfix(settings): add AbortController cleanup on namespace change (#147)\n\n* fix(settings): add AbortController cleanup on namespace change\n\nEach settings tab now creates an AbortController in its loadSettings\nuseEffect, passes the signal to the storageService call, and aborts\non cleanup. Aborted requests are silently ignored to prevent stale\nresponses from racing on rapid project switches.\n\nCloses #143\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(settings): guard setLoading against aborted signal in finally blocks\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume