rs/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/commits/985677ad277f5ab20e78147c22a99118d466e37e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T22:34:00Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T22:34:00Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"message":"fix(transfer): add mountedRef guard, deduplicate buildTransferPath, memoize selectedFiles filter\n\n- Guard setIsCancelling(false) in handleCancel''s finally block with\n  mountedRef.current, matching the pattern used in startTransfer and\n  handleCheckConflicts to prevent state updates after unmount\n- Extract buildTransferPath into src/app/utils/transferUtils.ts and\n  import it in both TransferModal.tsx and StorageBrowser.tsx, replacing\n  the inline string template in the transfer:completed handler so the\n  format is defined in one place\n- Wrap files.filter() for selectedFiles prop in StorageBrowser with\n  useMemo([files, selectedFiles]) to avoid creating a new array reference\n  on every render and unnecessarily invalidating TransferModal''s hook chain\n- Add unit tests for buildTransferPath in transferUtils.spec.ts\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"07af0c9807cf74b988f5636624a6efc2d9c1e334","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/git/trees/07af0c9807cf74b988f5636624a6efc2d9c1e334"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/