"type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/commits/589239619eed1f93ca815b03d14625692616cf24/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T19:37:41Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T19:37:41Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"message":"feat: Transfer System (Phase 9)\n\nAdd cross-storage transfer functionality with real-time SSE progress:\n\n- Fix transfer types to match storage backend API contract (TransferRequest,\n  TransferJob, ConflictCheckResult, TransferProgress)\n- Add cancelTransfer, cleanupTransfer, getTransferProgress, getTransferSseUrl\n  to storageService\n- Create typed event emitter for cross-component transfer events\n- Build TransferModal with 3-step flow: destination picker, conflict\n  resolution, and SSE-based progress tracking with cancel support\n- Wire \"Transfer to...\" bulk action in StorageBrowser toolbar\n- Auto-refresh file listing when transfer completes to current location\n- Add 37 unit tests covering emitter, service methods, and TransferModal\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0ca2e23b945bbbf7908169cd6b164f306084495c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/git/trees/0ca2e23b945bbbf7908169cd6b164f306084495c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/git/commits/589239619eed1f93ca815b03d14625692616cf24","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3944034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimou","id":3944034,"login":"guimou","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDQwMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/commit/589239619eed1f93ca815b03d14625692616cf24","node_id":"C_kwDOTXi2CNoAKDU4OTIzOTYxOWVlZDFmOTNjYTgxNWIwM2QxNDYyNTY5MjYxNmNmMjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/commit/b0da2b84e74d6ce5b2e09bde0cef220df73f20ca","sha":"b0da2b84e74d6ce5b2e09bde0cef220df73f20ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/commits/b0da2b84e74d6ce5b2e09bde0cef220df73f20ca"}],"sha":"589239619eed1f93ca815b03d14625692616cf24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/commits/589239619eed1f93ca815b03d14625692616cf24"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3944034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimou","id":3944034,"login":"guimou","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDQwMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/commits/b0da2b84e74d6ce5b2e09bde0cef220df73f20ca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T19:13:44Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T19:13:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Storage Browser advanced features (Phase 8) (#118)\n\n* feat(storage-browser): add file preview with DocumentRenderer\n\nAdd DocumentRenderer component supporting preview of JSON, YAML,\nMarkdown, plain text, code files (via PF6 CodeBlock), and images\n(inline display). Unsupported types show a \"Download to view\"\nfallback. File names and EyeIcon button open the preview modal.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(storage-browser): add multi-select with checkboxes and bulk delete\n\nAdd checkbox column to file listing table with select all/deselect all.\nBulk action toolbar appears when items are selected with \"Delete Selected\"\nand \"Clear Selection\" actions. Bulk delete confirmation modal with progress.\nSelections clear on location/path navigation.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(storage-browser): add HuggingFace model import with SSE progress\n\nAdd HuggingFaceImportModal component with model ID input, optional\ntoken override, and destination prefix. SSE progress tracking via\nEventSource shows real-time file count and current file. Add\nimportHuggingFace() method to storageService and types.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test: add unit tests for Phase 8 features\n\nAdd DocumentRenderer tests (30): file type detection, rendering modes\n(JSON, text, image, unsupported), loading/error states, user actions.\nAdd HuggingFaceImportModal tests (9): form validation, S3/PVC params,\nerror handling, progress display.\nUpdate StorageBrowser tests (+11): preview button visibility, multi-select\ncheckboxes, bulk action toolbar, bulk delete, HF import button.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: resolve lint error in DocumentRenderer test\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address review findings (round 1)\n\n- Fix viewFile JSON response: normalize parsed objects back to string\n  before rendering in DocumentRenderer (apiClient.get parses JSON)\n- Fix clipboard: await writeText, clean up timeout on unmount\n- Fix useEffect deps: use location.id/type instead of object reference\n- Fix EventSource: use server-provided sseUrl, add error feedback on\n  SSE connection loss\n- Optimize: compute getFileType once per row, use Map in bulk delete\n- Remove redundant selectedLocation guard in toolbar\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(storage): extract TransferProgress type to shared storage types (#127)\n\nCloses #116\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(storage-browser): guard DocumentRenderer .finally() against abort race (#128)\n\nCloses #126\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(storage-browser): use addEventListener for named SSE events (#129)\n\nThe storage backend sends named ''progress'' events, but EventSource.onmessage\nonly fires for unnamed events. Switch to addEventListener(''progress'', ...).\n\nCloses #119\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(storage-browser): stop checkbox click from opening preview modal (#130)\n\nAdd stopPropagation() to the checkbox onSelect handler to prevent the\nclick event from bubbling to the row''s onRowClick handler.\n\nCloses #121\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(storage-browser): add recursive-deletion warning to bulk delete modal (#131)\n\nShow a warning alert when any selected item is a directory, matching\nthe behavior of the single-file delete modal.\n\nCloses #124\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(storage-browser): clear previewFile on location/path navigation (#132)\n\nCloses #125\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(storage-browser): build bulk delete fileMap from unfiltered files (#134)\n\nUse the unfiltered files array instead of sortedFiles (search-filtered)\nto ensure all selected files are found during bulk delete, even if\nhidden by an active search filter.\n\nCloses #122\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(storage-browser): keep selectedFiles on bulk delete error for retry (#135)\n\nOnly clear selectedFiles in the success path so users can retry failed\nbulk deletions without re-selecting files.\n\nCloses #123\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(storage-browser): clear selectedFiles on project switch (#133)\n\nAdd selectedProject to the reset useEffect dependency array to prevent\nstale selections from persisting across project switches.\n\nCloses #120\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(storage-browser): add abort race regression test for DocumentRenderer .finally()\n\nVerifies that the aborted fetch''s .finally() does not prematurely clear the\nloading spinner when the component re-renders with a new file prop. The test\nre-renders with a different file (causing the old fetch to be aborted) and\nasserts the spinner stays visible while the new fetch is in flight.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a91bf96f7ad6c68cec6d96a01db2dec93f9749f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/git/trees/a91bf96f7ad6c68cec6d96a01db2dec93f9749f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/git/commits/b0da2b84e74d6ce5b2e09bde0cef220df73f20ca","verification":{"payload":"tree a91bf96f7ad6c68cec6d96a01db2dec93f9749f9\nparent 9571fc242be5362a71cd86a3e166bcc3db8bb8b4\nparent 1af468b4287b467404d46049dfdf335b9936045d\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784142824 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784142824 +0100\n\nfeat: Storage Browser advanced features (Phase 8) (#118)\n\n* feat(storage-browser): add file preview with DocumentRenderer\n\nAdd DocumentRenderer component supporting preview of JSON, YAML,\nMarkdown, plain text, code files (via PF6 CodeBlock), and images\n(inline display). Unsupported types show a \"Download to view\"\nfallback. File names and EyeIcon button open the preview modal.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users