ffect deps: use location.id/type instead of object reference\n- Fix EventSource: use server-provided sseUrl, add error feedback on\n  SSE connection loss\n- Optimize: compute getFileType once per row, use Map in bulk delete\n- Remove redundant selectedLocation guard in toolbar\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(storage): extract TransferProgress type to shared storage types (#127)\n\nCloses #116\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(storage-browser): guard DocumentRenderer .finally() against abort race (#128)\n\nCloses #126\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(storage-browser): use addEventListener for named SSE events (#129)\n\nThe storage backend sends named ''progress'' events, but EventSource.onmessage\nonly fires for unnamed events. Switch to addEventListener(''progress'', ...).\n\nCloses #119\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(storage-browser): stop checkbox click from opening preview modal (#130)\n\nAdd stopPropagation() to the checkbox onSelect handler to prevent the\nclick event from bubbling to the row''s onRowClick handler.\n\nCloses #121\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(storage-browser): add recursive-deletion warning to bulk delete modal (#131)\n\nShow a warning alert when any selected item is a directory, matching\nthe behavior of the single-file delete modal.\n\nCloses #124\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(storage-browser): clear previewFile on location/path navigation (#132)\n\nCloses #125\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(storage-browser): build bulk delete fileMap from unfiltered files (#134)\n\nUse the unfiltered files array instead of sortedFiles (search-filtered)\nto ensure all selected files are found during bulk delete, even if\nhidden by an active search filter.\n\nCloses #122\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(storage-browser): keep selectedFiles on bulk delete error for retry (#135)\n\nOnly clear selectedFiles in the success path so users can retry failed\nbulk deletions without re-selecting files.\n\nCloses #123\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(storage-browser): clear selectedFiles on project switch (#133)\n\nAdd selectedProject to the reset useEffect dependency array to prevent\nstale selections from persisting across project switches.\n\nCloses #120\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(storage-browser): add abort race regression test for DocumentRenderer .finally()\n\nVerifies that the aborted fetch''s .finally() does not prematurely clear the\nloading spinner when the component re-renders with a new file prop. The test\nre-renders with a different file (causing the old fetch to be aborted) and\nasserts the spinner stays visible while the new fetch is in flight.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqV9voCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOlkQACXPHsAjl7574