alse,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/commits/f5b5506d06124f564a1aab38289d1061934c7270/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T16:31:47Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T16:31:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(storage-browser): warn when contains search only covers loaded files (#114)\n\n* fix(storage-browser): warn when contains search only covers loaded files\n\nShow an inline info Alert when the user is searching in contains mode on\nan S3 location that has additional pages beyond those already loaded.\nThe warning advises loading more files or switching to Prefix search for\ncomplete server-side results.\n\nCloses #101\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address PR review findings (round 1)\n\nReplace HTML entity curly quotes with plain ASCII double quotes in the\ncontains-search warning alert. Add three tests covering the alert\nrendering conditions: shows when contains + S3 + more pages; hidden in\nprefix mode; hidden when all pages loaded.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"11ba02c8ee254ce43d745e221527a2a8c2aa6af7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/git/trees/11ba02c8ee254ce43d745e221527a2a8c2aa6af7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/git/commits/f5b5506d06124f564a1aab38289d1061934c7270","verification":{"payload":"tree 11ba02c8ee254ce43d745e221527a2a8c2aa6af7\nparent 4e1be22f16caee1910e7b15d8e803a6dc213572a\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784133107 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784133107 +0100\n\nfix(storage-browser): warn when contains search only covers loaded files (#114)\n\n* fix(storage-browser): warn when contains search only covers loaded files\n\nShow an inline info Alert when the user is searching in contains mode on\nan S3 location that has additional pages beyond those already loaded.\nThe warning advises loading more files or switching to Prefix search for\ncomplete server-side results.\n\nCloses #101\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address PR review findings (round 1)\n\nReplace HTML entity curly quotes with plain ASCII double quotes in the\ncontains-search warning alert. Add three tests covering the alert\nrendering conditions: shows when contains + S3 + more pages; hidden in\nprefix mode; hidden when all pages loaded.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqV7XzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA7n4QABKOyL/O95ohjU8R+qym8WSP\nXI26BZzf48Wwy4+j0vtkhst3biGJCHc6J/kZ5W/cG+8Mn11H3a/hqkrOsUpoVoRY\nTlpjGSUlAU9gDOfHYdAkNoKofQIi2zznI7JPeQ4UNUJ1dpGI0PAX8FOqtB/m4q9E\nk392PqzIF/V9rTxETQh7kcguHIHrsak8hP/1HVZ+XPZC+k9wFDYkNHCofRnmf3LT\nKjbBMj7xLL1WqvhN1TMpQUoShj0Apr6xzInMbWmSi8HM1TtekLvtJZLTzXO6nI8e\nVKE27srSge6GrdJ/o5/z8/EX4ZjBwZYP07gWyz1dAaTSQxMp3LggMpV/D2zdu0+Y\nWT8aYjWdVvfoUTuXYYhQnCRBEUp/nwkDzx/+o9n9AjBa/2r3ajD1xGNuBeHM+mtG\n5kNzlweabCuNNyM5nuGVTn0eq7cccxhx2CxkS4fPcF4qBXMBXLIRtp/5mZKrHenC\ng0c/CzMABGj6DhuV7lX8YJFnSv31j