ithub.com/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/commit/d1de173aa9a627cacb942ff88dc2044d5aa24824","sha":"d1de173aa9a627cacb942ff88dc2044d5aa24824","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/commits/d1de173aa9a627cacb942ff88dc2044d5aa24824"}],"sha":"7e474da5036e391f24cf6a8f2bdcc6098cbde66e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/commits/7e474da5036e391f24cf6a8f2bdcc6098cbde66e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3944034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimou","id":3944034,"login":"guimou","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDQwMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/commits/d1de173aa9a627cacb942ff88dc2044d5aa24824/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T16:11:07Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T16:11:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(storage-browser): add error handling to handleRefresh (#111)\n\n* fix(storage-browser): add error handling to handleRefresh\n\nAdd .catch() to the refreshLocations() promise chain in handleRefresh\nto surface network errors via setFilesError, matching the existing\nerror-handling convention used in loadFiles and the locations useEffect.\nPreviously, network failures silently produced unhandled promise rejections\nwith no user-visible feedback.\n\nFixes #105\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(storage-browser): use functional updater for setLocalOffset\n\nReplace the stale-closure form with a functional updater so that\nconcurrent state updates during Load More cannot corrupt the PVC\npagination offset.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address PR review findings (round 1)\n\nAdd test for the refresh error path in StorageBrowser — asserts that when\nrefreshLocations rejects, a danger Alert with the error message is rendered.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1d17878f230435c255914e19ef1c8d460b34b5db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/git/trees/1d17878f230435c255914e19ef1c8d460b34b5db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/git/commits/d1de173aa9a627cacb942ff88dc2044d5aa24824","verification":{"payload":"tree 1d17878f230435c255914e19ef1c8d460b34b5db\nparent 72ae074044c50a65326aad1e6061e5e8cdf73d0e\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784131867 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784131867 +0100\n\nfix(storage-browser): add error handling to handleRefresh (#111)\n\n* fix(storage-browser): add error handling to handleRefresh\n\nAdd .catch() to the refreshLocations() promise chain in handleRefresh\nto surface network errors via setFilesError, matching the existing\nerror-handling convention used in loadFiles and the locations useEffect.\nPreviously, network failures silently produced unhandled promise rejections\nwith no user-visible feedback.\n\nFixes #105\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(storage-browser): use functional updater for setLocalOffset\n\nReplace the stale-closure form with a functional updater so that\nconcurrent state updates during Load More cannot corrupt the PVC\npagination offset.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address PR review findings (round 1)\n\nAdd test for the refresh error path in StorageBrowser — asserts that when\nrefreshLocations rejects, a danger Alert with the error message is rendered.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqV7EbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQoYQAHwGWsDtCPEk+aSnrPAx/v9d\nRDicKg76qAe2ceebgAJwQ5PS2w+jwy0ImS5n/n3OEVHIK2jxnpMrZ4G2P8SjM7WC\nl8ZzL9x7Mbdh6bj8pKBylF0befU3gJPlhsrjVRuKYv31lVcNGVODgTCzNv89yHKq\nPTtWx40ijgf/VgACYQd30OH8yJl5oX3et4HBwJkirvITdZH9hhUK3uUaa9i2wvND\nGRBWE1uLa/GTMSuVJAMgyhWN/ZS/AJV1PtdUCmcc3JiL1x8oRDTVxJa1sYGUZKmF\nteLaM0ZVS3w5pr42oC42EiK/RrsK1qF2vQNSbIQiYbA+CLSH+TVDcM70xw0D4/pb\nVjRZuH8FjR+AOZvhyFssxKI7hKp7TShrts/24hVzI71OgjEeFDMEwOGQqaRBlA9c\ntCPyuY2mSR96arv2cH79gR7fJo5T+sCrM/Y3Me8u9P9ugMdhrvx/4L4xjYf+AVf2\niquQEQ1DEYCfnq6x2h2YmhftyycHkFoCkdZBvAmyAks5uCZKJwpUzp5JXvw55Wlb\nM3wCR6XRtjfTw1Wr7UM5Uf82Mz2h1pGi6cTR3/FBU7UKb+BT3W6TFXJKRwIfLMGQ\nq0deCKPDtGaCZwcG7VXdTcYCw9ZkuLXSXzKpX5cU2O3rIVNZEDDqE+g1l1eXKlRP\nDUItRPjurQJWZ8uFqmU5\n=xj0b\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-15T16:11:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avata