e_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDQwMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/commits/72ae074044c50a65326aad1e6061e5e8cdf73d0e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T16:10:56Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T16:10:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(storage-browser): add error handling to handleDownload (#110)\n\n* fix(storage-browser): add error handling to handleDownload\n\nWrap the async storageService.downloadFile call in a try/catch block.\nOn failure, surface the error via a new downloadError state rendered as\na dismissible inline Alert above the file listing, matching the pattern\nused by handleDelete/deleteError.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address PR review findings (round 1)\n\n- Clear downloadError on location/path change (useEffect on [locationId, encodedPath])\n- Add test for downloadFile rejection rendering error alert\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"25f5df9601add7139ef97ab44b37b766fc96fba7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/git/trees/25f5df9601add7139ef97ab44b37b766fc96fba7"},"url":"https://