noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T16:05:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(format): guard formatBytes against fractional byte values (#108)\n\nAdd Math.max(0, ...) to the exponent calculation so that inputs in the\nrange (0, 1) clamp to exponent 0 (bytes) instead of producing a negative\nindex that resolves to UNITS[negative] === undefined.\n\nFixes #107.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7bac9e25f5f3f0b2bce5bde1e5e8c1a7da6067be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/git/trees/7bac9e25f5f3f0b2bce5bde1e5e8c1a7da6067be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/git/commits/6cb42098793ded006887f23fe3fe2ae888ec0de1","verification":{"payload":"tree 7bac9e25f5f3f0b2bce5bde1e5e8c1a7da6067be\nparent c65fab87c1709b995290497661278dac41947d68\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784131527 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784131527 +0100\n\nfix(format): guard formatBytes against fractional byte values (#108)\n\nAdd Math.max(0, ...) to the exponent calculation so that inputs in the\nrange (0, 1) clamp to exponent 0 (bytes) instead of producing a negative\nindex that resolves to UNITS[negative] === undefined.\n\nFixes #107.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqV6/HCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWNsQAFCikTpqCFU1fhjV7FvDeT3n\nMqBLnHbTXhH8ORhEzYZPRveeR/tp3hrfCzDZ8ea00CKZIoq3sStutRbbgxlNnTkS\nZ6UztmeTzyeKghOC9rB+gkjiIb93ylTsf9Qpx2S38cU4bntrdgTfcUHtnDsjnCQq\n9fRXZfRMt2bjAimvTXYTKxH2L+13nEZorwx8jmEhL5T4zE3H2hJVjhWtGxyvrBXN\nLgmwF6Wu4Ce8gbRQa54nRXkJKgdrgV48DrgL/LlBp1M6IlKz66+UtieZyp4QVzD/\n++3RMaFrYPsJV85stxS596mHFodl5YnrU/W3yrEx5b8u/EXJXnQaT8vto9i