s/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/commits/1a285f95f80a5823f756c8b5cb9d8c012002580c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T15:01:30Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T15:01:30Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"message":"feat: implement Storage Browser page with core file operations\n\nReplace the StorageBrowserPage placeholder with a fully functional\nstorage browser supporting S3 buckets and PVC locations. The browser\nuses the existing storageService layer (Phase 6) for all data-plane\noperations through the BFF.\n\nFeatures:\n- Location selector dropdown (S3 + PVC locations from storageService)\n- Breadcrumb navigation with clickable path segments\n- File listing table (folders first, then files, alphabetically)\n- Continuation token pagination (S3) and offset pagination (PVC)\n- Search/filter with prefix (server-side for S3) and contains modes\n- File upload with multi-file picker and drag-and-drop\n- File download via browser download link\n- Delete with confirmation modal (recursive warning for folders)\n- Create folder modal with storage-type-specific name validation\n- formatBytes utility for human-readable file sizes\n\nURL routing: /brewet/storage/browse/:locationId?/:path?\nwhere locationId is plain text and path is URL-safe base64 encoded.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"15cb0021ef59d65b6bade89e44fd8d6e3a76f330","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/git/trees/15cb0021ef59d65b6bade89e44fd8d6e3a76f330"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/