Moutier"},"message":"chore: reset version to 0.1.0 and rename rhoai-brewet to brewet\n\nThe project inherited v0.4.0 and the \"rhoai-\" prefix from the seed\nscaffold. Reset all version references to 0.1.0, fix sync-chart-version\nto cover storage-backend/package.json, bff_image.tag in plugin.yaml,\nand the fallback image tag in k8sResources.ts. Rename rhoai-brewet to\nbrewet across chart templates, CI, scripts, docs, and config. Silence\nact() warnings in StorageManagementPage tests and Node.js deprecation\nwarnings in BFF tests.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3c32bda0a24ac1ad9b85596dac6ef370a5fda6e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/git/trees/3c32bda0a24ac1ad9b85596dac6ef370a5fda6e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/git/commits/cac2f1d304eca131969349d2681ece3151e25143","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3944034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimou","id":3944034,"login":"guimou","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDQwMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"htt