u/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/commits/e4458aa7a828171b052576450d86a658dd8f2140/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T12:59:05Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T12:59:05Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"message":"fix: address review findings (round 2)\n\nThree high-severity issues found by architecture review:\n\n- H1: Remove double /api prefix from all storageService paths.\n  The BFF proxy already prepends /api before forwarding to the\n  storage backend, so paths must be /buckets not /api/buckets.\n\n- H2: Fix local locations response shape mismatch. Backend returns\n  { locations: [...] } (wrapped object), not a bare array.\n\n- H3: Fix S3 bucket property casing. Backend sends raw AWS SDK\n  objects with PascalCase (Name, CreationDate), not camelCase.\n  Updated BucketInfo type and all references.\n\nUpdated all tests to match corrected paths and types.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"819a053f60462eab3cb215876b97379b7a091c3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/git/trees/819a053f60462eab3cb215876b97379b7a091c3d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/git/commits/e4458aa7a828171b052576450d86a658dd8f2140","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3944034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.gi