thub.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/commits/4f3804f3803dd23e66b8b22748fea75073a9d71b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T12:22:11Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T12:22:11Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"message":"chore(skills): improve fix-issues with worktrees, parallel batching, and cleanup\n\n- Add explicit model parameters to all agent spawn points (sonnet for\n  implementation/fix, opus for review) to avoid Vertex model errors\n- Use worktree isolation for implementation and fix agents so parallel\n  agents cannot corrupt each other''s working tree\n- Add execution planning step that groups issues into parallel batches\n  based on file-scope overlap\n- Strip duplicate Signed-off-by/Co-Authored-By trailers from agent\n  commits before pushing\n- Add per-batch and final cleanup steps to restore clean repo state\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"28ab60acea74e45453c566e9f514791bd85f10ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/git/trees/28ab60acea74e45453c566e9f514791bd85f10ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/git/commits/4f3804f3803dd23e66b8b22748fea75073a9d71b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3944034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.githu