"repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/commits/1a6657987e45edb99e76800a454e5db989513326/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T11:52:59Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T11:52:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: address phase-5 review findings (10 issues) (#82)\n\n* fix: address phase-5 review findings\n\nContainer lifecycle fixes:\n- Handle AbortError in createContainer — return abort marker, trigger\n  rollback of already-created resources (#76)\n- Remove abort signal from rollback DELETE calls so cleanup cannot be\n  cancelled by component unmount (#77)\n- Surface delete errors in modal instead of silently closing (#78)\n- Move isActioning to BrewetContext so concurrent start/stop from\n  toolbar and empty-state is prevented (#79)\n\nContainerWizard fixes:\n- Pre-populate edit mode with existing Deployment config by parsing\n  envFrom, volumes, and volumeMounts from ContainerInfo (#71, #75)\n- Conditionally render ContainerWizard to skip API calls when the\n  modal is closed (#80)\n- Use ~ path alias for sibling step imports (#81)\n\nInfrastructure:\n- Add polling guard (max 60 iterations / 5 min) for starting\n  containers; detect ProgressDeadlineExceeded and ReplicaFailure\n  conditions for early error transition (#73)\n- Make storage-backend image configurable from Helm values with\n  build-time injection via DefinePlugin (#72)\n\nCloses #71, closes #72, closes #73, closes #75, closes #76,\ncloses #77, closes #78, closes #79, closes #80, closes #81\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address PR review findings (round 1)\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2f79baba4069eb18026fb1344abea78aa6c36232","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/git/trees/2f79baba4069eb18026fb1344abea78aa6c36232"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/git/commits/1a6657987e45edb99e76800a454e5db989513326","verification":{"payload":"tree 2f79baba4069eb18026fb1344abea78aa6c36232\nparent 7e22236dab81d46e0b4e6d315458dd4201bf9181\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784116379 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784116379 +0100\n\nfix: address phase-5 review findings (10 issues) (#82)\n\n* fix: address phase-5 review findings\n\nContainer lifecycle fixes:\n- Handle AbortError in createContainer — return abort marker, trigger\n  rollback of already-created resources (#76)\n- Remove abort signal from rollback DELETE calls so cleanup cannot be\n  cancelled by component unmount (#77)\n- Surface delete errors in modal instead of silently closing (#78)\n- Move isActioning to BrewetContext so concurrent start/stop from\n  toolbar and empty-state is prevented (#79)\n\nContainerWizard fixes:\n- Pre-populate edit mode with existing Deployment config by parsing\n  envFrom, volumes, and volumeMounts from ContainerInfo (#71, #75)\n- Conditionally render ContainerWizard to skip API calls when the\n  modal is closed (#80)\n- Use ~ path alias for sibling step imports (#81)\n\nInfrastructure:\n- Add polling guard (max 60 iterations / 5 min) for starting\n  containers; detect ProgressDeadlineExceeded and ReplicaFailure\n  conditions for early error transition (#73)\n- Make storage-backend image configurable from Helm values with\n  build-time injection via DefinePlugin (#72)\n\nCloses #71, closes #72, closes #73, closes #75, closes #76,\ncloses #77, closes #78, closes #79, closes #80, closes #81\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address PR review findings (round 1)\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqV3SbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAIzoQAIAntowC8u6mqiba8jKb34L9\nUxDU3JsOcZcO3yk2x8Dp1L5/I74Mzk+nSNN1fq69dzD6VUt7iS5nWhg8vI48EBST\npgvP0it5KFoWD3V/VSka7U1Esd8zhhEWvBwQbi5cLLUv3Kd7FUqKqBH7L70urH/e\nG0satIqRVErG7hp0I9moHCDqfHlfqPEiHiMxfm5MGCb0DiusZ/ArFCwo4Teiz5sp\n209LJ+iKN85KfkKDdEooWxJ2I3JDvoiSY40b2WurmzfRxQnAsALj0A2EWMKR14rU\nnqkMw84W9Zel+gIndQ0KrmCUpV0Vcv9j8u9jYz8lmRa3jfbPLY55zWVvZgMrIM70\n5kF5wFVYVE1KgrNySZMssqsZeSJ6QcuQkuK64V8M+Jo+rK4EIGHG498rBGIA/iwu\nvbFWsHue4sE23qJ/yU7flfprUhN0UWt8aVx4FHcFCzANFnzMXKkaDmXrrwp/Sn5A\nG058hdfw7YGiEwMVy9CMrd9gXbv5MULJbFey8vCmdCnvVodoYLhuskgfMgdvxRyh\n7xGBeWmiuExQiqk3cUvrTc033KY2B16NoHy1dTWEz48MoIjKO/f6ZqTZV/nKRfes\n+QWXrVMZ6s0EabDPUOeJI3oQ1YUb8a7njLvgaKzWCPg2biOcS8hmqdIAADQMducd\n1ppPoi/zR8tThr/UrtkP\n=CdP3\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-15T11:52:59Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"