hub.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/commits/7e22236dab81d46e0b4e6d315458dd4201bf9181/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T11:10:45Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T11:10:45Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"message":"fix: address review findings (round 1)\n\n- Add securityContext to generated Deployment for OpenShift restricted SCC\n- Fix rowIndex hardcoded to 0 in PVC selection table\n- Wrap atob() in try-catch to handle malformed base64 in secrets\n- Add mount path validation (traversal, system dirs, duplicates)\n- Add rollback on partial container create failure\n- Clear timer before overwrite in useBrewetContainer\n- Handle ''starting'' and ''error'' states in ContainerRequired\n- Use PATCH instead of PUT for deployment updates (avoids resourceVersion conflicts)\n- Export DEPLOYMENT_NAME from k8sResources (single source of truth)\n- Make BFF_NAMESPACE configurable via env var\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c0c103400810d09bcb69bccc2f269a9f03567052","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/git/trees/c0c103400810d09bcb69bccc2f269a9f03567052"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/brewet/git/commits/7e22236dab81d46e0b4e6d315458dd4201bf9181","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3944034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/gists{/gist_