followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tomingtoming","id":469008,"login":"tomingtoming","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2OTAwOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/commits/966d742fb435d2a14bb8fc9ca8d6427386f59df9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T09:41:02Z","email":"tomingtoming@gmail.com","name":"toming"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T09:41:02Z","email":"tomingtoming@gmail.com","name":"toming"},"message":"0.4.0: LQで既定アバター(スキン無しプレースホルダー)が映らない不具合を修正\n\n工房実機での複数アカウント検証（toming 2026-07-15）で既定アバターの\n正体を特定: SkinnedMeshでもTHIRD_PERSON_ONLYタグでもなく、Blenderの\n原始図形（Cone/Cube/Icosphere）を体パーツとして、名前付きボーン風\nObject3D（hips/spine/chest/neck/head/shoulderL/handL/...）に直接\nぶら下げた「セグメント方式」の簡易プレースホルダーだった。userDataに\nアプリ側の意図的なマーカーは無し（GLTF由来の元名前が残るのみ）。\n\ncollectMirrorTargets に3つ目の検出パスを追加: メッシュの親がヒューマノイド\n関節名（hips/spine/chest/neck/head/shoulder/hand等、正規化して比較）で、\nかつその祖先2階層以内にも関節名が連続する場合にアバターの一部とみなす。\n単発の偶然一致（例: ワールド家具の「宝箱(Chest)」）による誤検知を、\n関節名の連鎖要求で回避。\"root\"は汎用的すぎるため判定から除外。\n\ndevハーネスにセグメント方式ダミー（緑）を追加し、既存のSkinnedMesh\nダミー（赤）・無関係な静的メッシュ（青）との映り分けをレンダーターゲット\n直読みで検証: red/green検出・blue非検出を確認、既存動作に無回帰。\n\n探索用に一時追加した診断コード（debugDumpAvatarCandidateMeshes等、\n0.3.4〜0.3.7で使用）は原因特定が完了したため撤去。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TpRG2watB63MUc5r4Vy5yx","tree":{"sha":"4b2710f45bea2efff7564ebc094a1791a78fc839","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/git/trees/4b2710f45bea2efff7564ebc094a1791a78fc839"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/git/commits/966d742fb435d2a14bb8fc9ca8d6427386f59df9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/469008?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tomingtoming","id":469008,"login":"tomingtoming","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2OTAwOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/commit/966d742fb435d2a14bb8fc9ca8d6427386f59df9","node_id":"C_kwDOTXkHRNoAKDk2NmQ3NDJmYjQzNWQyYTE0YmI4ZmM5Y2E4ZDY0MjczODZmNTlkZjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/commit/bc2e47f06a95779ad89b0b455b48b2a5df96f75b","sha":"bc2e47f06a95779ad89b0b455b48b2a5df96f75b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/commits/bc2e47f06a95779ad89b0b455b48b2a5df96f75b"}],"sha":"966d742fb435d2a14bb8fc9ca8d6427386f59df9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/commits/966d742fb435d2a14bb8fc9ca8d6427386f59df9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/469008?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tomingtoming","id":469008,"login":"tomingtoming","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2OTAwOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/commits/bc2e47f06a95779ad89b0b455b48b2a5df96f75b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T09:15:07Z","email":"tomingtoming@gmail.com","name":"toming"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T09:15:07Z","email":"tomingtoming@gmail.com","name":"toming"},"message":"0.3.7: 実機診断 - 名前付きコンテナ直下のメッシュだけに絞ったダンプ\n\n0.3.6のdebugDumpAllMeshes(全80件)はワールドの無関係な物体で埋まり、\n既定アバターのパーツ(named containerの直接の子)まで届かなかった疑い。\ndebugDumpAvatarCandidateMeshesへ変更: 「名前付きコンテナの直接の子で\nあるメッシュだけ」に絞る＝無関係なワールド物体を自然に除外しつつ、\nセグメント方式アバターの各パーツをピンポイントで拾う（切り分け専用・\n撤去予定）。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TpRG2watB63MUc5r4Vy5yx","tree":{"sha":"37de58f62e4b1049c167e47bc3466da5ccb1e277","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/git/trees/37de58f62e4b1049c167e47bc3466da5ccb1e277"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/git/commits/bc2e47f06a95779ad89b0b455b48b2a5df96f75b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/469008?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tomingtoming","id":469008,"login":"tomingtoming","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2OTAwOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/commit/bc2e47f06a95779ad89b0b455b48b2a5df96f75b","node_id":"C_kwDOTXkHRNoAKGJjMmU0N2YwNmE5NTc3OWFkODliMGI0NTViNDhiMmE1ZGY5NmY3NWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/commit/3bd1f018ac478561a7748223f0c838cd861c8e6f","sha":"3bd1f018ac478561a7748223f0c838cd861c8e6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/commits/3bd1f018ac478561a7748223f0c838cd861c8e6f"}],"sha":"bc2e47f06a95779ad89b0b455b48b2a5df96f75b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/commits/bc2e47f06a95779ad89b0b455b48b2a5df96f75b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/469008?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tomingtoming","id":469008,"login":"tomingtoming","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2OTAwOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/commits/3bd1f018ac478561a7748223f0c838cd861c8e6f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T08:51:21Z","email":"tomingtoming@gmail.com","name":"toming"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T08:51:21Z","email":"tomingtoming@gmail.com","name":"toming"},"message":"0.3.6: 実機診断 - 既定アバターの正体判明(セグメント方式リグ)、userData確認用に拡張\n\ndebugSceneOutlineの実機ログで既定アバターの正体が判明: SkinnedMesh\n1枚ではなく、体の各パーツ(頭・首・胸・肩・上腕・前腕・手)ごとに\n個別の無名Meshが、名前付きボーン風Object3D(root/hips/spine/chest/\nneck/head/shoulderL/upper_armL/...)にぶら下がる「セグメント方式」\nのリグだった（カスタムVRM側とは命名規則・構造が別物）。\n\nボーン名パターンマッチで拾う実装は将来の命名変更で静かに壊れる\nリスクがあるため、先にuserData（アプリ側が意図的に仕込んだ目印が\nないか）を確認する。debugDumpNamedMeshes→debugDumpAllMeshesへ拡張\nし、無名メッシュも拾って直近の名前付き祖先とuserDataキーを表示\n（切り分け専用・撤去予定）。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TpRG2watB63MUc5r4Vy5yx","tree":{"sha":"a6c0ae004a371f420ed8fd7c569faa9fc0d9cb0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/git/trees/a6c0ae004a371f420ed8fd7c569faa9fc0d9cb0e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xri