/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tomingtoming","id":469008,"login":"tomingtoming","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2OTAwOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/commits/50007313ebcfa208c4cb969dd7a845059094bc05/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T08:29:21Z","email":"tomingtoming@gmail.com","name":"toming"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T08:29:21Z","email":"tomingtoming@gmail.com","name":"toming"},"message":"0.3.5: 実機診断 - 名前付きコンテナごとのメッシュ内訳ダンプを追加\n\n0.3.4のdebugDumpNamedMeshesは「名前付きメッシュ」だけを見ていたが、\n実機ログでは既定アバターがその6件に1件も含まれないと判明。実体が\n名前無しのメッシュで構成されている可能性が高いため、debugSceneOutline()\nで「名前付きコンテナ（グループ等）ごとに配下のskinned/mesh内訳を集計」\nする方式に変更。名前無しリーフでも名前付き祖先経由で存在を検出できる\n（切り分け専用・撤去予定）。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TpRG2watB63MUc5r4Vy5yx","tree":{"sha":"8f31e1abb013383d5978229670db1e899f18389d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/git/trees/8f31e1abb013383d5978229670db1e899f18389d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/git/commits/50007313ebcfa208c4cb969dd7a845059094bc05","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/469008?v=4