":"tomingtoming","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2OTAwOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/commits/10b372ec6e198c32563c1c272451b5718b3bf0a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T08:09:32Z","email":"tomingtoming@gmail.com","name":"toming"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T08:09:32Z","email":"tomingtoming@gmail.com","name":"toming"},"message":"0.3.4: 実機診断 - LQ既定アバター不可視の正体特定用メッシュダンプ追加\n\n0.3.3のTHIRD_PERSON_ONLY判定は工房実機で不発（thirdPersonOnly=0）。\n既定アバターは直接目視では通常の三人称3Dボディが見える（toming確認済み）\nのに、SkinnedMeshでもTHIRD_PERSON_ONLYでもない＝検出網の外側にいる\n未知の型で描画されている。debugDumpNamedMeshes()でLQ初回スキャン時に\n名前付きメッシュ系オブジェクト（Mesh/SkinnedMesh/InstancedMesh/Sprite）\nを型問わず洗い出し、実機ログから正体を特定する（切り分け専用・撤去予定）。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TpRG2watB63MUc5r4Vy5yx","tree":{"sha":"954b00c8972388bf4a841719fbe72ba1fc1e1659","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/git/trees/954b00c8972388bf4a841719fbe72ba1fc1e1659"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/git/commits/10b372ec6e198c32563c1c272451b5718b3bf0a4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/469008?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/followers","following_url":"https://api.githu