ing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/commits/3c7cc3552aa8a9cc93ef71892ea6d8fbb7238ec6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T07:31:51Z","email":"tomingtoming@gmail.com","name":"toming"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T07:31:51Z","email":"tomingtoming@gmail.com","name":"toming"},"message":"0.3.3: LQでXRift既定アバター(スキン無し)が映らない不具合を修正\n\n実機診断（toming 2026-07-15、工房）: カスタムVRMはLQに映るが、既定\nアバターは映らないと判明。既定アバターはSkinnedMeshを持たない\nプレースホルダー形状のため、SkinnedMesh検出だけのavatarLayer.tsでは\n拾えなかった。ホスト（@xrift/world-components）自身が三人称専用\nパーツにlayer 10（THIRD_PERSON_ONLY）を明示付与しているので、\nSkinnedMesh検出に加えてこのレイヤー会員資格も判定に使うよう拡張\n（layer番号の参照のみ・実装コードは含まない）。\n\ndevハーネスで確認: 修正後、ローカルプレイヤーの非スキン三人称\nプロキシが新たにLQミラーに映るようになった（既存のSkinnedMesh経路は\n無傷）。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TpRG2watB63MUc5r4Vy5yx","tree":{"sha":"b9501fc4fe8850f7543d9adeac9a3601dd34553a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/git/trees/b9501fc4fe8850f7543d9adeac9a3601dd34553a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/git/commits/3c7cc3552aa8a9cc93ef71892ea6d8fbb7238ec6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/469008?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomi