:false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/commits/720f6ebd258a84d51a4e3fb7ef2abb121ce9330e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T13:27:41Z","email":"tomingtoming@gmail.com","name":"toming"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T13:27:41Z","email":"tomingtoming@gmail.com","name":"toming"},"message":"0.3.2: 実機診断をwarnレベル+全段階に強化・Textアウトラインの不正hex修正\n\n「LQ scanログが出ない」報告への切り分け版。infoはコンソールフィルタで\n隠れがち→warnへ。バナー(版確認)・mode切替・MirrorSurfaceマウント・\n反射パス初回実行・LOD遷移の各段階にログ=どこで止まるか一発判定。\noutlineColor #00000088(8桁hex)はTHREE.Colorが解釈不能→#000000+outlineOpacityへ。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EVHBUGKmqgvmoRZBc4vDtz","tree":{"sha":"d6478ec499a30f04d9117efc1e00099f46d3f0ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/git/trees/d6478ec499a30f04d9117efc1e00099f46d3f0ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/git/commits/720f6ebd258a84d51a4e3fb7ef2abb121ce9330e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/469008?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tomingtoming","id":469008,"login":"tomingtoming","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2OTAwOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.