url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/commits/30176a3a3250703618d8018de4fe5d80cacc1fef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T12:30:30Z","email":"tomingtoming@gmail.com","name":"toming"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T12:30:30Z","email":"tomingtoming@gmail.com","name":"toming"},"message":"0.3.1: LQタグ付けを反射直前フックへ移動＋実機診断ログ\n\n工房実機で「VRMがLQに映らない」報告（toming 2026-07-14）への対策。\n仮説=ホストが毎フレームアバターのlayersを設定し直し、useFrame時点の\nタグ(30番ビット)が反射前に消される（公式Mirrorの「毎フレーム設定が必要」\nコメントと同型）。対策=LayeredReflector.onBeforeReflect（反射レンダリング\n直前）で毎フレーム当て直し。全走査は60フレームごと・間はキャッシュへの\nenable()のみ（冪等・極小コスト）。切り分け用に[xrift-mirror]プレフィクスの\nスキャン診断ログを追加（状態変化時のみ出力・skinned=0の検出用）。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EVHBUGKmqgvmoRZBc4vDtz","tree":{"sha":"722e13b66468df9f80329ec0eab381a43495b90c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/git/trees/722e13b66468df9f80329ec0eab381a43495b90c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/git/commits/30176a3a3250703618d8018de4fe5d80cacc1fef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/469008?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tomingtoming","id":469008,"login":"tomingtoming","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2OTAwOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/commit/30176a3a3250703618d8018de4fe5d80cacc1fef","node_id":"C_kwDOTXkHRNoAKDMwMTc2YTNhMzI1MDcwMzYxOGQ4MDE4ZGU0ZmU1ZDgwY2FjYzFmZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/commit/d040e1765358e151ee8f01eba60b567cd44c6d14","sha":"d040e1765358e151ee8f01eba60b567cd44c6d14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/commits/d040e1765358e151ee8f01eba60b567cd44c6d14"}],"sha":"30176a3a3250703618d8018de4fe5d80cacc1fef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/commits/30176a3a3250703618d8018de4fe5d80cacc1fef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/469008?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tomingtoming","id":469008,"login":"tomingtoming","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2OTAwOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/commits/d040e1765358e151ee8f01eba60b567cd44c6d14/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T11:41:07Z","email":"tomingtoming@gmail.com","name":"toming"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T11:41:07Z","email":"tomingtoming@gmail.com","name":"toming"},"message":"モードを既定で操作者ローカルに（sync propでオプトイン同期）\n\n鏡は見る人のための道具＝他人が消したら自分も消える同期はお節介になりがち\n（toming裁定 2026-07-14）。XRiftStandMirrorをLocal/Synced二枚に分け、\nuseInstanceStateはsync=true時のみ。アイテム説明文も「押した人にだけ反映」へ。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EVHBUGKmqgvmoRZBc4vDtz","tree":{"sha":"a970c62487839c1cf57491031ff1302ccff9590f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/git/trees/a970c62487839c1cf57491031ff1302ccff9590f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/git/commits/d040e1765358e151ee8f01eba60b567cd44c6d14","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/469008?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tomingtoming","id":469008,"login":"tomingtoming","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2OTAwOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/commit/d040e1765358e151ee8f01eba60b567cd44c6d14","node_id":"C_kwDOTXkHRNoAKGQwNDBlMTc2NTM1OGUxNTFlZThmMDFlYmE2MGI1NjdjZDQ0YzZkMTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/commit/eb7c1f11f1f9ea47cf36b65c5d036eb8865f7be8","sha":"eb7c1f11f1f9ea47cf36b65c5d036eb8865f7be8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/commits/eb7c1f11f1f9ea47cf36b65c5d036eb8865f7be8"}],"sha":"d040e1765358e151ee8f01eba60b567cd44c6d14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/commits/d040e1765358e151ee8f01eba60b567cd44c6d14"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/469008?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tomingtoming","id":469008,"login":"tomingtoming","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2OTAwOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/commits/eb7c1f11f1f9ea47cf36b65c5d036eb8865f7be8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T10:16:25Z","email":"tomingtoming@gmail.com","name":"toming"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T10:16:25Z","email":"tomingtoming@gmail.com","name":"toming"},"message":"v3: 公式<Mirror>を撤去しthree.js Reflectorフォークで自前実装・LQ=アバターだけ映る\n\n- LayeredReflector: three.js Reflector(MIT)のフォーク。反射用仮想カメラを\n  自前所有し reflectLayersMask で「鏡に映すもの」を選択可能に。\n  blendOverlay色合成も撤去（恒等ミラー＝色かぶりなし）\n- LQモードの意味を変更: 低解像度(256) → アバターだけ映る(512)。\n  SkinnedMesh+ライトに鏡専用レイヤー(30)をビット追加（非破壊・毎秒再走査）し、\n  反射パスのドローコールをアバター数体分まで削減（VRChatのLQミラーと同じ発想）\n- HQは一人称専用レイヤー(9)除外の全景＝毎フレームenableAllハック不要\n- @xrift/world-components依存をxrift.tsxアダプタに隔離（optional peer化）:\n  xrift-mirror本体はthree+R3Fのみ / xrift-mirror/xrift のXRiftStandMirrorが\n  useInstanceState(全員同期)とInteractable(VR操作)を注入\n- 距離LOD自前実装（10m超で反射停止→消灯ガラス・ヒステリシス0.8）\n- dev: LQ検証用ダミーアバター(SkinnedMesh)と静的箱で映り分けを確認済み\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EVHBUGKmqgvmoRZBc4vDtz","tree":{"sha":"f97ac1a13c3e4fd41d53cf058a27d97d9efb17ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/git/trees/f97ac1a13c3e4fd41d53cf058a27d97d9efb17ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tomingtoming/xrift-mirror/git/commits/eb7c1f11f1f9ea47cf36b65c5d036eb8865f7be8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/469008?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tomingtoming","id":469008,"login":"tomingtoming","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2OTAwOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomingtoming","user_vi