api.github.com/repos/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/commits/b8c7aea130cbbc020d83e40ef11f3517a9e86564/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T17:49:50Z","email":"ynaka@adobe.com","name":"ynaka-adobe-com"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T17:49:50Z","email":"ynaka@adobe.com","name":"ynaka-adobe-com"},"message":"Point Create account / Enroll Now at the real enrollment URL\n\nENROLL_URL now points to https://www.southwest.com/loyalty/enroll/,\ncovering both the logged-out \"Create account\" link and the popover''s\n\"Enroll Now\" link since they share the same constant. Verified both\nhrefs in a real browser.","tree":{"sha":"6747a64eea59fd2d78a09e552c95db9544a66c25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/git/trees/6747a64eea59fd2d78a09e552c95db9544a66c25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/git/commits/b8c7aea130cbbc020d83e40ef11f3517a9e86564","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1873249?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ynakagawa","id":1873249,"login":"ynakagawa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NzMyNDk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/commit/b8c7aea130cbbc020d83e40ef11f3517a9e86564","node_id":"C_kwDOTXqwAtoAKGI4YzdhZWExMzBjYmJjMDIwZDgzZTQwZWYxMWYzNTE3YTllODY1NjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/commit/b38a4765db8e38d4626831d97f2a27ef9a4a6f87","sha":"b38a4765db8e38d4626831d97f2a27ef9a4a6f87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/commits/b38a4765db8e38d4626831d97f2a27ef9a4a6f87"}],"sha":"b8c7aea130cbbc020d83e40ef11f3517a9e86564","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/commits/b8c7aea130cbbc020d83e40ef11f3517a9e86564"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1873249?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ynakagawa","id":1873249,"login":"ynakagawa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NzMyNDk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/commits/b38a4765db8e38d4626831d97f2a27ef9a4a6f87/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T16:38:07Z","email":"ynaka@adobe.com","name":"ynaka-adobe-com"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T16:38:07Z","email":"ynaka@adobe.com","name":"ynaka-adobe-com"},"message":"Add mock login capability with session-persisted logged-in state\n\nSubmitting the login form now accepts any non-empty account\nnumber/username + password (there''s no real Southwest auth API to\nvalidate against) and generates a mock points balance. The session is\nstored in sessionStorage as { username, points } — persists across\nreloads in the same browser session/tab, clears on tab/browser close or\n\"Log out\", matching the requested session-scoped (not permanent)\npersistence.\n\nLogged-out UI now matches the reference screenshot: \"Log in to view\npoints balance\" prompt, the existing trigger/popover, and a \"Create\naccount\" link. Logged-in UI replaces all of that with \"Hi, {username}\n{points} points  My Account | Log out\".\n\nAlso fixed a CSS bug found while verifying: .sw-login__link--button used\nthe `font: inherit` shorthand, which resets font-weight too, so \"Log out\"\nrendered non-bold next to the bold \"My Account\" link — replaced with\nexplicit font-family/font-size overrides instead.\n\nVerified end to end in headless Chromium: mock login accepted, logged-in\nbar persists across page reload in the same browser context, a fresh\ncontext is logged out, and \"Log out\" correctly reverts to the logged-out\nUI. Also re-verified inside the tabbed combined demo.","tree":{"sha":"c52fcf2c502aac1ebe2336ebfd19c82bdc3c5ec1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/git/trees/c52fcf2c502aac1ebe2336ebfd19c82bdc3c5ec1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/git/commits/b38a4765db8e38d4626831d97f2a27ef9a4a6f87","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1873249?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ynakagawa","id":1873249,"login":"ynakagawa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NzMyNDk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/commit/b38a4765db8e38d4626831d97f2a27ef9a4a6f87","node_id":"C_kwDOTXqwAtoAKGIzOGE0NzY1ZGI4ZTM4ZDQ2MjY4MzFkOTdmMmEyN2VmOWE0YTZmODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/commit/a65dc5dc75b082ece465c3cbc02f1a2203492430","sha":"a65dc5dc75b082ece465c3cbc02f1a2203492430","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/commits/a65dc5dc75b082ece465c3cbc02f1a2203492430"}],"sha":"b38a4765db8e38d4626831d97f2a27ef9a4a6f87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/commits/b38a4765db8e38d4626831d97f2a27ef9a4a6f87"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1873249?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ynakagawa","id":1873249,"login":"ynakagawa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NzMyNDk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/commits/a65dc5dc75b082ece465c3cbc02f1a2203492430/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T16:29:16Z","email":"ynaka@adobe.com","name":"ynaka-adobe-com"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T16:29:16Z","email":"ynaka@adobe.com","name":"ynaka-adobe-com"},"message":"Fix login popover closing on every click inside its own form\n\nThe outside-click handler listened on document and checked event.target,\nbut events crossing a shadow boundary get target retargeted to the host\nelement (<sw-login>), which containerRef (inside the shadow root) never\n\"contains\". Every click or keystroke inside the username/password fields\nwas misread as an outside click, closing the popover immediately.\n\nFixed by checking event.composedPath() instead, which preserves the real\nevent path across shadow boundaries. Verified with real Playwright\nclick/type interactions: typing in both fields and clicking the checkbox\nnow keep the panel open, while a genuine outside click still closes it.","tree":{"sha":"2cb3b2e9ca9c93a8f9cac0a22ef796d4455815a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/git/trees/2cb3b2e9ca9c93a8f9cac0a22ef796d4455815a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/git/commits/a65dc5dc75b082ece465c3cbc02f1a2203492430","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1873249?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ynakagawa","id":1873249,"login":"ynakagawa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NzMyNDk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/commit/a65dc5dc75b082ece465c3cbc02f1a2203492430","node_id":"C_kwDOTXqwAtoAKGE2NWRjNWRjNzViMDgyZWNlNDY1YzNjYmMwMmYxYTIyMDM0OTI0MzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/commit/344ffb98eeb5ed3acec5ad9e2f2e8be02eccdf96","sha":"344ffb98eeb5ed3acec5ad9e2f2e8be02eccdf96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/commits/344ffb98eeb5ed3acec5ad9e2f2e8be02eccdf96"}],"sha":"a65dc5dc75b082ece465c3cbc02f1a2203492430","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/commits/a65dc5dc75b082ece465c3cbc02f1a2203492430"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1873249?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ynakagawa","id":1873249,"login":"ynakagawa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NzMyNDk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/commits/344ffb98eeb5ed3acec5ad9e2f2e8be02eccdf96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T14:02:01Z","email":"ynaka@adobe.com","name":"ynaka-adobe-com"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T14:02:01Z","email":"ynaka@adobe.com","name":"ynaka-adobe-com"},"message":"Redesign combined demo as a tabbed Southwest Apps landing page\n\nModeled on cat-apps-sigma.vercel.app: a title bar (Southwest heart logo +\n\"Southwest Apps\"), a tab per MFE (Flight Search / Login / Feedback)\nshowing exactly one widget at a time, and a \"Show embed code\" toggle per\ntab revealing the <script> + custom element snippet for that widget.\nVerified in headless Chromium: tab switching hides/shows the right panel,\nand the embed code toggle reveals the correct snippet with no console\nerrors.","tree":{"sha":"13ac71b765bc1352c40fad8226f097cc78b881e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/git/trees/13ac71b765bc1352c40fad8226f097cc78b881e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/git/commits/344ffb98eeb5ed3acec5ad9e2f2e8be02eccdf96","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1873249?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ynakagawa","id":1873249,"login":"ynakagawa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NzMyNDk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/commit/344ffb98eeb5ed3acec5ad9e2f2e8be02eccdf96","node_id":"C_kwDOTXqwAtoAKDM0NGZmYjk4ZWViNWVkM2FjZWM1YWQ5ZTJmMmU4YmUwMmVjY2RmOTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/commit/5234a70d521d7d80bf6e091e4a90e217e465bc00","sha":"5234a70d521d7d80bf6e091e4a90e217e465bc00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/commits/5234a70d521d7d80bf6e091e4a90e217e465bc00"}],"sha":"344ffb98eeb5ed3acec5ad9e2f2e8be02eccdf96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/commits/344ffb98eeb5ed3acec5ad9e2f2e8be02eccdf96"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1873249?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ynakagawa","id":1873249,"login":"ynakagawa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NzMyNDk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/commits/5234a70d521d7d80bf6e091e4a90e217e465bc00/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T13:56:32Z","email":"ynaka@adobe.com","name":"ynaka-adobe-com"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T13:56:32Z","email":"ynaka@adobe.com","name":"ynaka-adobe-com"},"message":"Make the combined examples demo deployable as its own Vercel project\n\nexamples/combined-demo.html referenced the three MFEs'' dist/ output by\nrelative path, which only works for local serving — deployed on its own,\nVercel had no package.json to detect and fell back to guessing Create\nReact App, producing \"react-scripts build ... exited with 127\" (this repo\nhas no CRA dependency anywhere).\n\nAdded examples/build.mjs, which builds all three MFEs and assembles a\nflat, self-contained dist/ (index.html + the three widget bundles side by\nside, with script paths rewritten), plus package.json/vercel.json so\nVercel runs that build instead of guessing. Verified the built dist/\noutput serves and renders all three widgets correctly.","tree":{"sha":"fd3783cdf317e92450d93504cb69bb3d9845f28b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/git/trees/fd3783cdf317e92450d93504cb69bb3d9845f28b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/git/commits/5234a70d521d7d80bf6e091e4a90e217e465bc00","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1873249?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ynakagawa","id":1873249,"login":"ynakagawa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NzMyNDk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/orgs","r