/api.github.com/repos/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/commits/58f4762f006d52c4e73a8799d7a4e4db787c0c48/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T03:11:20Z","email":"ynaka@adobe.com","name":"ynaka-adobe-com"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T03:11:20Z","email":"ynaka@adobe.com","name":"ynaka-adobe-com"},"message":"Add feedback MFE web component and EDS block\n\nReact feedback tab + panel (goal dropdown, accomplished yes/no, comments\ntextarea, Contact Us link) built as a self-contained <sw-feedback> web\ncomponent, same Vite IIFE + shadow DOM pattern as the other two MFEs.\nTab and panel are position: fixed inside the shadow root so it stays\nanchored to the viewport edge regardless of where the EDS block sits in\nthe page. Unlike flight-search/login there''s no sensible redirect target\nfor a feedback submission, so submit is stubbed (console.log + a \"Thanks\"\nconfirmation state) behind an onSubmit prop for later wiring to a real\nendpoint. Includes an EDS block, embed demo, and Vercel config; verified\ninteractively (open/close/scroll/submit) in headless Chromium. Also wired\ninto examples/combined-demo.html alongside the other two widgets.","tree":{"sha":"00bd138d0670b085a3e7ed3067643ffe501e08f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/git/trees/00bd138d0670b085a3e7ed3067643ffe501e08f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ynakagawa/southwest-apps/git/commits/58f4762f006d52c4e73a8799d7a4e4db787c0c48","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1873249?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ynakagawa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ynakagawa","i