e":"2026-07-14T07:14:35Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T07:14:54Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"message":"Add Custom AI Instructions + Target Clip Duration\n\nFrontend:\n- Custom prompt input in HighlightsPanel (placeholder: ''Find the emotional moments...'')\n- Target duration 3-button selector (Under 30s / 30-60s / 1 minute+)\n- Both options passed to highlight detection API\n\nBackend:\n- detectHighlights() accepts customPrompt + targetDuration params\n- Custom prompt scoring: keyword overlap + pattern library (emotional, funny, tip, story, hook, viral)\n- Duration adjustment: snaps highlight boundaries to sentence edges within target range\n  - under-30: 15-29s, 30-60: 30-60s, 60-plus: 60-90s\n- API route accepts + validates new params\n- Settings store has defaultTargetDuration\n\nVerified: ''Find the emotional moments'' + ''Under 30 seconds'' → 5 highlights, all 15-17.8s, top match references the prompt in reasoning.","tree":{"sha":"e10a2869d1c5bf40d143fcc01fabb3348b5c797d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m32805356-eng/ClipForge/git/trees/e10a2869d1c5bf40d143fcc01fabb3348b5c797d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m32805356-eng/ClipForge/git/commits/7fa077fb76a9edb1e5fcafb2fb55592897742d30","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/m32805356-eng/ClipForge/commit/7fa077fb76a9edb1e5fcafb2fb55592897742d30","node_id":"C_kwDOTXrxH9oAKDdmYTA3N2ZiNzZhOWVkYjFlNWZjYWZiMmZiNTU1OTI4OTc3NDJkMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/m32805356-eng/ClipForge/commit/2afd9413935acadd29b1cf4bb1e584220e694930","sha":"2afd9413935acadd29b1cf4bb1e584220e694930","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m32805356-eng/ClipForge/commits/2afd9413935acadd29b1cf4bb1e584220e694930"}],"sha":"7fa077fb76a9edb1e5fcafb2fb55592897742d30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m32805356-eng/ClipForge/commits/7fa077fb76a9edb1e5fcafb2fb55592897742d30"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m32805356-eng/ClipForge/commits/2afd9413935acadd29b1cf4bb1e584220e694930/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T02:14:29Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T02:15:20Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"message":"ClipForge: local-first AI video clipping app\n\nFull pipeline: upload → transcribe (Whisper) → detect highlights → cut clips → burn subtitles → crop vertical → download.\n\nFeatures:\n- Opus Clip-style UI with icon rail, feature grid, command palette (cmd+K)\n- Upload local files or paste YouTube/Vimeo links (yt-dlp)\n- faster-whisper transcription with 5 model sizes + word-level timestamps\n- Heuristic highlight detection (6 categories: hook, emotional, story, funny, educational, viral)\n- FFmpeg clip cutting with configurable padding\n- ASS subtitle burning (4 styles: bold-white, karaoke, neon-amber, minimal)\n- Vertical crop to 1080x1920 for social media\n- Batch operations (Burn All, Crop All, Process All)\n- Settings with persistent preferences (localStorage)\n- System health monitoring (db, ffmpeg, python, whisper, disk)\n\nTech: Next.js 16, TypeScript, Tailwind 4, shadcn/ui, Prisma+SQLite, Zustand, TanStack Query, faster-whisper, yt-dlp, FFmpeg.","tree":{"sha":"8356d84bb0d69c476bb4cec0ccbed2537f3fecc8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m32805356-eng/ClipForge/git/trees/8356d84bb0d69c476bb4cec0ccbed2537f3fecc8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m32805356-eng/ClipForge/git/commits/2afd9413935acadd29b1cf4bb1e584220e694930","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/m32805356-eng/ClipForge/commit/2afd9413935acadd29b1cf4bb1e584220e694930","node_id":"C_kwDOTXrxH9oAKDJhZmQ5NDEzOTM1YWNhZGQyOWIxY2Y0YmIxZTU4NDIyMGU2OTQ5MzA","parents":[],"sha":"2afd9413935acadd29b1cf4bb1e584220e694930","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m32805356-eng/ClipForge/commits/2afd9413935acadd29b1cf4bb1e584220e694930"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/m32805356-eng/ClipForge/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=f93e4ff5d78443d554a9abcfff0b430528ea1507&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A21%3A57.959Z"}');
