 background on pill/rounded inputs\n\nChrome/Safari paint autofill''s own background as a plain rectangle behind\nthe field, ignoring the `background` property. Against a fully-rounded pill\ninput (mo-input, ml-auth-input) that rectangle peeks out past the corners,\nreading as a second, overlapping input field — reported against\nclarity-board''s sign-in form. Fixed with the standard box-shadow inset\noverride (plus -webkit-text-fill-color, which autofill also overrides) on\nboth packages'' input styles.","tree":{"sha":"9069ec0cb85f36f2b6c705a2de879e2bb73e1188","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adusingi/design-system/git/trees/9069ec0cb85f36f2b6c705a2de879e2bb73e1188"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adusingi/design-system/git/commits/7a2ebdd80dc91cac7cc773255caf57b4fbc56abc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25784462?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adusingi","id":25784462,"login":"adusingi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Nzg0NDYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adusingi/design-system/commit/7a2ebdd80dc91cac7cc773255caf57b4fbc56abc","node_id":"C_kwDOTYADxNoAKDdhMmViZGQ4MGRjOTFjYWM3Y2M