der is the content\n(documented components, the line token, shadow demos).\n\n- Hero: ink-drawdown strata of the active theme, display headline at\n  specimen scale, mono kicker instead of pill eyebrow\n- Color: full-bleed poured bands sized by role; line token shown as an\n  actual rule; theme gallery as borderless drawdown strips\n- Typography: true waterfall specimen, no rules between rows; Cormorant\n  Garamond italic now loaded (was synthesized)\n- Sections: namespace markers (@mobayilo/themes, --mo-text-*, ...) replace\n  01-05 numbering; whitespace replaces border-top\n- Components: one full-bleed panel-soft field, exhibits sit directly on it\n- Footer: thin drawdown echo strip replaces border-top\n- docs: add OKF redesign proposal","tree":{"sha":"eb557352eed22a1de772c32c086882993f61a0a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adusingi/design-system/git/trees/eb557352eed22a1de772c32c086882993f61a0a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adusingi/design-system/git/commits/f8ca710a4022e4e3629d45ac76999f091640b2c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25784462?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adusingi","id":25784462,"login":"adusingi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Nzg0NDYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/subscriptions","ty