and catppuccin latte were only\nreachable via the header''s ThemeSwitcher — easy to miss entirely. Add a\ngrid of all 10 themes with their own preview swatches; click to switch,\nhover to preview.","tree":{"sha":"34125e10c7025eada3d2dbe67f3134bfaa11a8a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adusingi/design-system/git/trees/34125e10c7025eada3d2dbe67f3134bfaa11a8a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adusingi/design-system/git/commits/14da8b7243c0d2b3088f22bd94b6305b9ec1b850","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25784462?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adusingi","id":25784462,"login":"adusingi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Nzg0NDYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adusingi/design-system/commit/14da8b7243c0d2b3088f22bd94b6305b9ec1b850","node_id":"C_kwDOTYADxNoAKDE0ZGE4YjcyNDNjMGQyYjMwODhmMjJiZDk0YjYzMDViOWVjMWI4NTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adusingi/design-system/commit/5d73ce39e8883eaf9797e78efeebe5f9de3e94cf","sha":"5d73ce39e8883eaf9797e78efeebe5f9de3e94cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adusingi/design-system/commits/5d73ce39e8883eaf9797e78efeebe5f9de3e94cf"}],"sha":"14da8b7243c0d2b3088f22bd94b6305b9ec1b850","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adusingi/design-system/commits/14da8b7243c0d2b3088f22bd94b6305b9ec1b850"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25784462?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adusingi","id":25784462,"login":"adusingi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Nzg0NDYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adusingi/design-system/commits/5d73ce39e8883eaf9797e78efeebe5f9de3e94cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T02:37:37Z","email":"aimabled@gmail.com","name":"adusingi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T02:37:37Z","email":"aimabled@gmail.com","name":"adusingi"},"message":"Wire the real Mobayilo font pairing and add EntryCard\n\nThe homepage was falling back to a generic system font stack. mobayilo,\nacademy-mobayilo, and inkoranyamuga all hardcode the same pairing\n(Cormorant Garamond for headings, Inconsolata for everything else) — make\nthat the @mobayilo/ui default and self-host both via next/font in the site\napp so it actually renders instead of silently falling through.\n\nAdd @mobayilo/ui''s EntryCard: a media card generalized from mytrip''s place\ncard (image+badge, title, meta tags, description, checklist, expandable\nnote, two footer actions). Same component, demoed both as a travel entry\n(Love it / Open) and a umuzika library entry (Favorite / Play) — only\ncontent, icons, and action variants differ.","tree":{"sha":"eca7543cad921d4959c5ae4bb829f4ea0d26684e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adusingi/design-system/git/trees/eca7543cad921d4959c5ae4bb829f4ea0d26684e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adusingi/design-system/git/commits/5d73ce39e8883eaf9797e78efeebe5f9de3e94cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25784462?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adusingi","id":25784462,"login":"adusingi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Nzg0NDYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adusingi/design-system/commit/5d73ce39e8883eaf9797e78efeebe5f9de3e94cf","node_id":"C_kwDOTYADxNoAKDVkNzNjZTM5ZTg4ODNlYWY5Nzk3ZTc4ZWZlZWJlNWY5ZGUzZTk0Y2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adusingi/design-system/commit/365223457d74703766cce761367d5964a219f848","sha":"365223457d74703766cce761367d5964a219f848","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adusingi/design-system/commits/365223457d74703766cce761367d5964a219f848"}],"sha":"5d7