,"received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adusingi/design-system/commits/d49037401cdf6b21af268554d5d25f63da266682/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T15:55:42Z","email":"aimabled@gmail.com","name":"adusingi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T15:55:42Z","email":"aimabled@gmail.com","name":"adusingi"},"message":"auth-magic-link: preserve plugin-tuple inference + portable session helper\n\nTwo fixes surfaced while integrating into a real Next app (mytrip):\n\n- createMagicLinkAuth now keeps the plugins as a literal tuple\n  [magicLink, ...extra, nextCookies] (generic over extra plugins) so Better\n  Auth infers endpoints like auth.api.signInMagicLink onto the returned type;\n  the previous widened plugins array erased them. Add zod as an (optional) peer\n  so the inferred return type is nameable in the emitted .d.ts (fixes TS2742).\n- createSessionHelpers is generic over the consumer''s auth type and infers the\n  user shape from *their* better-auth resolution, avoiding the \"two different\n  types with this name exist\" clash under pnpm''s isolated installs.\n\nVerified: package typecheck + build clean; consumed cleanly by mytrip.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"917b9bb5ee6e651b1c0ebfe9d9a371ccdb992c93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adusingi/design-system/git/trees/917b9bb5ee6e651b1c0ebfe9d9a371ccdb992c93"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adusingi/design-system/git/commits/d49037401cdf6b21af268554d5d25f63da266682","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25784462?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adusingi","id":25784462,"login":"adusingi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Nzg0NDYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adusingi/design-system/commit/d49037401cdf6b21af268554d5d25f63da266682","node_id":"C_kwDOTYADxNoAKGQ0OTAzNzQwMWNkZjZiMjFhZjI2ODU1NGQ1ZDI1ZjYzZGEyNjY2ODI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adusingi/design-system/commit/bd30ec7b87e0a59e94a6c593c5bc621303e5c5ec","sha":"bd30ec7b87e0a59e94a6c593c5bc621303e5c5ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adusingi/design-system/commits/bd30ec7b87e0a59e94a6c593c5bc621303e5c5ec"}],"sha":"d49037401cdf6b21af268554d5d25f63da266682","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adusingi/design-system/commits/d49037401cdf6b21af268554d5d25f63da266682"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25784462?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adusingi","id":25784462,"login":"adusingi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Nzg0NDYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adusingi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adusingi/design-system/commits/bd30ec7b87e0a59e94a6c593c5bc621303e5c5ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T15:42:46Z","email":"aimabled@gmail.com","name":"adusingi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T15:42:46Z","email":"aimabled@gmail.com","name":"adusingi"},"message":"Initial design-system: themes, auth-magic-link, telegram-connect\n\nA pnpm monorepo of reusable building blocks shared across mobayilo projects,\nextracted from the repetition identified in the portfolio analysis.\n\n- @mobayilo/themes — theme tokens (CSS vars) + ThemeProvider/ThemeSwitcher/\n  useTheme; 10 themes, mobayilo default. Configurable storageKey/defaultThemeId.\n- @mobayilo/auth-magic-link — Better Auth magic link (+ optional Google),\n  ZeptoMail email, session helpers, SignInForm. Storage-agnostic factory.\n- @mobayilo/telegram-connect — webhook-based Telegram account/group linking\n  with hashed TTL tokens and Drizzle/memory storage adapters (validated).\n\nAll packages build with tsc (per-file ESM + .d.ts; \"use client\" preserved) and\ntypecheck clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ac50e81bb4e3ee69c5b956415c6a8b4b73443bb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adusingi/design-system/git/trees/ac50e81bb4e3ee69c5b956415c6a8b4b73443bb6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adusingi/design-system/git/commits/bd30ec7b87e0a59e94a6c593c5bc621303e5c5ec","ve