pe":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/avetavos/realworld-mosaic/commits/e6be7566b58281fc982fe1acf6f799e6a5cc401e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T16:07:29Z","email":"avetavos@hotmail.com","name":"Aveta Vos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T16:07:29Z","email":"avetavos@hotmail.com","name":"Aveta Vos"},"message":"fix: guide now builds and runs as a federated app; many real defects (realworld phase 1+2)\n\nRebuilt the pnpm workspace from the lessons and ran shell + remotes live:\npnpm-workspace glob never matched apps/*/bff; apps/cart/package.json was\nnever created; tsconfig lacked jsx so every promised typecheck failed;\npackages had no tsconfig so their typecheck was a false pass; JSX\ncustom-element augmentations broke react''s export= resolution -> moved to\ncustom-elements.d.ts with export {}; m-price received numbers as\nproperties (no setter) -> String(); cart fetched its BFF relatively and hung\ninside the shell -> VITE_CART_BFF; window.__mfShared is not real ->\nwindow.__FEDERATION__.__SHARE__; shared array form is not singleton;\ndts: false on all federation() configs (1.22 default throws); catalog\nloader had no .catch so RemoteBoundary never triggered -> CatalogLoader;\n''Try again'' cannot re-import a rejected chunk -> reload; React pins ^19;\nreact-router v8 declarative mode, no react-router-dom; catalog-bff commands\nand duplicate server merged; five CLI/tree fences tagged text. check 0 -> 0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YCkiuR2uoWov1YvrYzd2zZ","tree":{"sha":"9df1b0a02a79d0a4f9184f46127c8040abb79d50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/avetavos/realworld-mosaic/git/trees/9df1b0a02a79d0a4f9184f46127c8040abb79d50"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/avetavos/realworld-mosaic/git/commits/e6be7566b58281fc982fe1acf6f799e6a5cc401e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified