.s@celigo.com","name":"ShritiSCeligoIO"},"message":"Add STAGE-1.md: beginner-friendly walkthrough of the Stage 1 library\n\nExplains, in plain language, every concept this stage introduces: what\nTypeScript is and that it vanishes at runtime, union and discriminated union\ntypes, type guards and type predicates, the Partial/Omit/Pick utility types,\npure functions and why they are trivial to test, the edge cases in\nstatsSummary, immutability, promises and async/await, what can go wrong when\ncalling a real API, centralised config with safe defaults and fail-fast\nvalidation, module and barrel exports, the strict compiler settings, and\ntests living beside their source.\n\nAlso records what is deliberately missing at this point and which later stage\naddresses each gap.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"d5da2c89d5827e352bbd44182d221be26d69cf1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShritiSCeligoIO/watchlog/git/trees/d5da2c89d5827e352bbd44182d221be26d69cf1c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShritiSCeligoIO/watchlog/git/commits/2473998dfa3690321b8a37d742cdf5fc846f5a38","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145531058?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShritiSCeligoIO/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShritiSCeligoIO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShritiSCeligoIO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShritiSCeligoIO/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ShritiSCeligoIO","id":145531058,"login":"ShritiSCeligoIO","node_id":"U_kgDOCKygsg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShritiSCeligoIO/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShritiSCeligoIO/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShritiSCeligoIO/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_u